    {"id":"bd4-01-run-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"run","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Male/35+/day/01-running.jpg","deck":{"ko":"블루의 볼륨은 얇은 셸 하나로 잡아요. 차콜 이너 위에서 지퍼를 조금 열고 소매의 실버 라인을 드러내요.","en":"Let the thin blue shell carry the colour. Open it slightly over charcoal and keep the silver sleeve accents visible.","de":"Die dünne blaue Jacke setzt die Farbe. Trage sie über Anthrazit leicht geöffnet und lasse die silbernen Ärmeldetails sichtbar."},"items":["bd4-01-run-m.outer","bd4-01-run-m.top","bd4-01-run-m.bottom","bd4-01-run-m.gloves","bd4-01-run-m.socks","bd4-01-run-m.shoes","bd4-01-run-m.headwear"],"article":{"title":"BLUE AT PACE","intro":{"ko":"블루의 볼륨은 얇은 셸 하나로 잡아요. 차콜 이너 위에서 지퍼를 조금 열고 소매의 실버 라인을 드러내요. 블랙 타이츠로 셸의 여유와 대비되는 슬림한 선을 만들어요. 발목은 깔끔하게 정리하고 종아리 반사선을 드러내요.","en":"Let the thin blue shell carry the colour. Open it slightly over charcoal and keep the silver sleeve accents visible. Balance the relaxed shell with fitted black tights. Keep the ankles neat and the reflective calf marks visible.","de":"Die dünne blaue Jacke setzt die Farbe. Trage sie über Anthrazit leicht geöffnet und lasse die silbernen Ärmeldetails sichtbar. Schwarze Tights bilden einen schmalen Gegenpol zur lockeren Jacke. Halte die Knöchel glatt und die Reflektoren an den Waden sichtbar."}}},
    {"id":"bd4-02-run-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"run","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Male/35+/day/02-running.jpg","deck":{"ko":"샌드 베이지 셸을 네이비 위에 열어 입어 밝고 어두운 면을 나눠요. 가슴의 세로 반사선이 작은 포인트가 돼요.","en":"Open the sand shell over navy to separate light and dark planes. The vertical chest reflector is a small accent.","de":"Trage die sandbeige Jacke über Marineblau offen, um helle und dunkle Flächen zu trennen. Der senkrechte Brustreflektor setzt einen kleinen Akzent."},"items":["bd4-02-run-m.outer","bd4-02-run-m.top","bd4-02-run-m.bottom","bd4-02-run-m.gloves","bd4-02-run-m.socks","bd4-02-run-m.shoes"],"article":{"title":"SAND AND NAVY","intro":{"ko":"샌드 베이지 셸을 네이비 위에 열어 입어 밝고 어두운 면을 나눠요. 가슴의 세로 반사선이 작은 포인트가 돼요. 네이비 조거의 여유 있는 허벅지와 모인 밑단을 살려요. 밑단은 그레이 양말 위에서 정리해 발목을 드러내요.","en":"Open the sand shell over navy to separate light and dark planes. The vertical chest reflector is a small accent. Keep the joggers relaxed through the thigh and gathered at the ankle. Finish the cuffs above the grey socks.","de":"Trage die sandbeige Jacke über Marineblau offen, um helle und dunkle Flächen zu trennen. Der senkrechte Brustreflektor setzt einen kleinen Akzent. Lasse die marineblauen Jogger am Oberschenkel locker sitzen. Ordne die gerafften Bündchen oberhalb der grauen Socken."}}},
    {"id":"bd4-03-run-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"run","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Male/35+/day/03-running.jpg","deck":{"ko":"딥그린 셸을 차콜 집넥 위에 열어 입어요. 상체의 두 어두운 톤 사이에서 실버 반사선이 선명하게 보여요.","en":"Open the deep green shell over the charcoal zip neck. Silver reflectors stand out between the two dark tones.","de":"Trage die dunkelgrüne Jacke über dem anthrazitfarbenen Zip-Neck-Shirt offen. Die silbernen Reflektoren heben sich von den dunklen Tönen ab."},"items":["bd4-03-run-m.outer","bd4-03-run-m.top","bd4-03-run-m.bottom","bd4-03-run-m.gloves","bd4-03-run-m.socks","bd4-03-run-m.shoes"],"article":{"title":"FOREST IN MOTION","intro":{"ko":"딥그린 셸을 차콜 집넥 위에 열어 입어요. 상체의 두 어두운 톤 사이에서 실버 반사선이 선명하게 보여요. 블랙 슬림 팬츠로 여유 있는 셸 아래 선을 정돈해요. 밑단을 접어 올려 종아리의 반사선을 가리지 않아요.","en":"Open the deep green shell over the charcoal zip neck. Silver reflectors stand out between the two dark tones. Keep the lower silhouette clean with slim black trousers. Leave the hems down so the calf reflectors remain visible.","de":"Trage die dunkelgrüne Jacke über dem anthrazitfarbenen Zip-Neck-Shirt offen. Die silbernen Reflektoren heben sich von den dunklen Tönen ab. Eine schmale schwarze Hose hält die untere Silhouette klar. Lasse die Säume unten, damit die Wadenreflektoren sichtbar bleiben."}}},
    {"id":"bd4-04-run-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"run","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Male/35+/day/04-running.jpg","deck":{"ko":"코럴 레드 셸을 버건디 위에 열어 따뜻한 색을 두 단계로 겹쳐요. 반사선과 가벼운 셸의 구김을 그대로 드러내요.","en":"Layer the coral shell open over burgundy for two levels of warm colour. Let the reflective marks and light fabric texture show.","de":"Trage die korallrote Jacke über Bordeaux offen und staffle warme Farben. Lasse Reflektoren und die leichte Knitterstruktur sichtbar."},"items":["bd4-04-run-m.outer","bd4-04-run-m.top","bd4-04-run-m.bottom","bd4-04-run-m.gloves","bd4-04-run-m.socks","bd4-04-run-m.shoes"],"article":{"title":"CORAL WARM-UP","intro":{"ko":"코럴 레드 셸을 버건디 위에 열어 따뜻한 색을 두 단계로 겹쳐요. 반사선과 가벼운 셸의 구김을 그대로 드러내요. 차콜 팬츠의 짧은 밑단으로 아이보리 양말을 드러내요. 종아리의 긴 반사선이 접히지 않게 밑단을 펴요.","en":"Layer the coral shell open over burgundy for two levels of warm colour. Let the reflective marks and light fabric texture show. Use the cropped charcoal hem to reveal ivory socks. Keep the long calf reflectors straight rather than rolling the hems.","de":"Trage die korallrote Jacke über Bordeaux offen und staffle warme Farben. Lasse Reflektoren und die leichte Knitterstruktur sichtbar. Der verkürzte anthrazitfarbene Saum zeigt die elfenbeinfarbenen Socken. Lasse die langen Wadenreflektoren glatt, statt die Säume umzuschlagen."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-05-run-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"run","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Male/35+/day/05-running.jpg","deck":{"ko":"네이비 셸을 밝은 크루넥 위에 조금 열어 입어요. 손목의 밝은 커프와 가슴 실버선으로 어두운 면을 나눠요.","en":"Open the navy shell slightly over a pale crew neck. Light cuffs and a silver chest mark break up the dark surface.","de":"Trage den marineblauen Windbreaker über einem hellen Rundhalsshirt leicht geöffnet. Helle Bündchen und ein silbernes Brustdetail gliedern die dunkle Fläche."},"items":["bd15-05-run-m.outer","bd15-05-run-m.top","bd15-05-run-m.bottom","bd15-05-run-m.gloves","bd15-05-run-m.socks","bd15-05-run-m.shoes","bd15-05-run-m.gear"],"article":{"title":"NAVY, WITH ORANGE","intro":{"ko":"네이비 셸을 밝은 크루넥 위에 조금 열어 입어요. 손목의 밝은 커프와 가슴 실버선으로 어두운 면을 나눠요. 차콜 타이츠로 네이비와 가까운 톤을 이어가요. 종아리 반사선과 그레이 양말의 경계는 또렷하게 보여줘요.","en":"Open the navy shell slightly over a pale crew neck. Light cuffs and a silver chest mark break up the dark surface. Continue navy with closely toned charcoal tights. Keep the calf reflector and grey sock boundary clearly visible.","de":"Trage den marineblauen Windbreaker über einem hellen Rundhalsshirt leicht geöffnet. Helle Bündchen und ein silbernes Brustdetail gliedern die dunkle Fläche. Anthrazitfarbene Tights führen Marineblau in einem ähnlichen Ton weiter. Lasse Wadenreflektor und Übergang zu den grauen Socken sichtbar."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-06-street-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"street","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Male/35+/day/06-street.jpg","deck":{"ko":"블랙 재킷에 라임 케이블 니트. 테라스에서 커피 한 잔.","en":"Black jacket over a lime cable knit. A coffee outside.","de":"Schwarze Jacke über limettengrünem Zopfstrick. Ein Kaffee draußen."},"items":["bd15-06-street-m.outer","bd15-06-street-m.top","bd15-06-street-m.bottom","bd15-06-street-m.shoes"]},
    {"id":"bd15-07-street-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"street","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Male/35+/day/07-street.jpg","deck":{"ko":"스웨이드 재킷에 패턴 팬츠, 흰 스니커즈.","en":"Suede jacket, patterned trousers, white sneakers.","de":"Wildlederjacke, gemusterte Hose, weiße Sneaker."},"items":["bd15-07-street-m.outer","bd15-07-street-m.top","bd15-07-street-m.bottom","bd15-07-street-m.shoes"]},
    {"id":"bd15-08-street-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"street","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Male/35+/day/08-street.jpg","deck":{"ko":"레드 재킷에 크림 니트, 와이드 진과 로퍼. 빵 사러.","en":"Red jacket, cream knit, wide jeans and loafers. Off to the bakery.","de":"Rote Jacke, cremefarbener Strick, weite Jeans und Loafer. Ab zum Bäcker."},"items":["bd15-08-street-m.outer","bd15-08-street-m.top","bd15-08-street-m.bottom","bd15-08-street-m.shoes"]},
    {"id":"bd15-09-street-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"street","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Male/35+/day/09-street.jpg","deck":{"ko":"네이비 재킷에 버건디 머플러, 올리브 팬츠.","en":"Navy jacket, burgundy scarf, olive trousers.","de":"Navy Jacke, bordeauxroter Schal, olivfarbene Hose."},"items":["bd15-09-street-m.outer","bd15-09-street-m.top","bd15-09-street-m.bottom","bd15-09-street-m.shoes","bd15-09-street-m.accessory"]},
    {"id":"bd15-10-street-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"street","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Male/35+/day/10-street.jpg","deck":{"ko":"베이지 퀼팅 재킷에 큰 머플러, 코듀로이 팬츠.","en":"Beige quilted jacket, a big scarf, corduroy trousers.","de":"Beige Steppjacke, großer Schal, Cordhose."},"items":["bd15-10-street-m.outer","bd15-10-street-m.top","bd15-10-street-m.bottom","bd15-10-street-m.accessory"]},
    {"id":"bd15-11-minimal-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Male/35+/day/11-minimal.jpg","deck":{"ko":"차콜 재킷 안에 크림 니트와 화이트 셔츠를 겹쳐요. 블랙 플리츠 팬츠와 페니 로퍼로 아래를 연결하고 가는 골드 체인으로 마무리해요.","en":"Layer a cream knit and white shirt under charcoal tailoring. Connect black pleated trousers to penny loafers and finish with a fine gold-tone chain.","de":"Trage cremefarbenen Strick und ein weißes Hemd unter dem anthrazitfarbenen Blazer. Schwarze Bundfaltenhose und Pennyloafer bilden eine Linie; eine feine goldfarbene Kette ergänzt den Look."},"items":["bd15-11-minimal-m.outer","bd15-11-minimal-m.top","bd15-11-minimal-m.under","bd15-11-minimal-m.bottom","bd15-11-minimal-m.shoes","bd15-11-minimal-m.jewelry"],"article":{"title":"CREAM IN CHARCOAL","intro":{"ko":"차콜 재킷 안에 크림 니트와 화이트 셔츠를 겹쳐요. 블랙 플리츠 팬츠와 페니 로퍼로 아래를 연결하고 가는 골드 체인으로 마무리해요.","en":"Layer a cream knit and white shirt under charcoal tailoring. Connect black pleated trousers to penny loafers and finish with a fine gold-tone chain.","de":"Trage cremefarbenen Strick und ein weißes Hemd unter dem anthrazitfarbenen Blazer. Schwarze Bundfaltenhose und Pennyloafer bilden eine Linie; eine feine goldfarbene Kette ergänzt den Look."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-12-minimal-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Male/35+/day/12-minimal.jpg","deck":{"ko":"오트밀 코트 안에서 코발트 크루넥을 선명하게 보여줘요. 다크 브라운 팬츠와 리브 삭스, 두꺼운 솔의 더비로 아래를 차분하게 연결해요.","en":"Let a cobalt crew neck stand out beneath an oatmeal coat. Ground the colour with dark brown trousers, rib socks and substantial derby soles.","de":"Lasse den kobaltblauen Rundhalspullover unter dem haferfarbenen Mantel leuchten. Dunkelbraune Hose, Rippensocken und Derbys mit kräftiger Sohle erden die Farbe."},"items":["bd15-12-minimal-m.outer","bd15-12-minimal-m.top","bd15-12-minimal-m.bottom","bd15-12-minimal-m.socks","bd15-12-minimal-m.shoes","bd15-12-minimal-m.jewelry"],"article":{"title":"COBALT UNDER OATMEAL","intro":{"ko":"오트밀 코트 안에서 코발트 크루넥을 선명하게 보여줘요. 다크 브라운 팬츠와 리브 삭스, 두꺼운 솔의 더비로 아래를 차분하게 연결해요.","en":"Let a cobalt crew neck stand out beneath an oatmeal coat. Ground the colour with dark brown trousers, rib socks and substantial derby soles.","de":"Lasse den kobaltblauen Rundhalspullover unter dem haferfarbenen Mantel leuchten. Dunkelbraune Hose, Rippensocken und Derbys mit kräftiger Sohle erden die Farbe."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-13-minimal-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Male/35+/day/13-minimal.jpg","deck":{"ko":"네이비 코트와 크림 터틀넥 사이에 그레이 머플러를 느슨하게 둘러요. 차콜 팬츠로 톤을 이어가고 실버 톤 체인을 커프 옆에 살짝 드러내요.","en":"Drape a grey scarf between a navy coat and cream turtleneck. Continue the soft tones with charcoal trousers and a silver-tone chain beside the cuff.","de":"Lege einen grauen Schal locker zwischen marineblauen Mantel und cremefarbenen Rollkragen. Anthrazitfarbene Hose und eine silberfarbene Kette am Bündchen führen die sanften Töne weiter."},"items":["bd15-13-minimal-m.outer","bd15-13-minimal-m.top","bd15-13-minimal-m.bottom","bd15-13-minimal-m.accessory","bd15-13-minimal-m.shoes","bd15-13-minimal-m.jewelry"],"article":{"title":"NAVY, SOFTENED","intro":{"ko":"네이비 코트와 크림 터틀넥 사이에 그레이 머플러를 느슨하게 둘러요. 차콜 팬츠로 톤을 이어가고 실버 톤 체인을 커프 옆에 살짝 드러내요.","en":"Drape a grey scarf between a navy coat and cream turtleneck. Continue the soft tones with charcoal trousers and a silver-tone chain beside the cuff.","de":"Lege einen grauen Schal locker zwischen marineblauen Mantel und cremefarbenen Rollkragen. Anthrazitfarbene Hose und eine silberfarbene Kette am Bündchen führen die sanften Töne weiter."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-14-minimal-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Male/35+/day/14-minimal.jpg","deck":{"ko":"카멜 울 재킷과 차콜 크루넥에 레드 머플러 하나를 더해요. 브라운 팬츠와 다크 브라운 앵클부츠로 아래를 정돈해 컬러 포인트를 살려요.","en":"Add one red scarf to a camel jacket and charcoal crew neck. Keep brown trousers and dark brown ankle boots quiet so the colour can lead.","de":"Ergänze zur kamelfarbenen Jacke und zum anthrazitfarbenen Rundhals einen roten Schal. Braune Hose und dunkelbraune Stiefeletten lassen dem Farbakzent Raum."},"items":["bd15-14-minimal-m.outer","bd15-14-minimal-m.top","bd15-14-minimal-m.bottom","bd15-14-minimal-m.shoes","bd15-14-minimal-m.accessory","bd15-14-minimal-m.jewelry"],"article":{"title":"RED ON CAMEL","intro":{"ko":"카멜 울 재킷과 차콜 크루넥에 레드 머플러 하나를 더해요. 브라운 팬츠와 다크 브라운 앵클부츠로 아래를 정돈해 컬러 포인트를 살려요.","en":"Add one red scarf to a camel jacket and charcoal crew neck. Keep brown trousers and dark brown ankle boots quiet so the colour can lead.","de":"Ergänze zur kamelfarbenen Jacke und zum anthrazitfarbenen Rundhals einen roten Schal. Braune Hose und dunkelbraune Stiefeletten lassen dem Farbakzent Raum."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-15-minimal-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Male/35+/day/15-minimal.jpg","deck":{"ko":"차콜 울 재킷 아래 크림 니트와 크림 와이드 팬츠를 이어 입어요. 브라운 리브 삭스와 페니 로퍼로 발끝을 묶고 가는 골드 톤 브레이슬릿을 더해요.","en":"Connect cream knitwear to cream wide trousers beneath a charcoal jacket. Anchor the look with brown rib socks and penny loafers, then add a fine gold-tone bracelet.","de":"Verbinde unter der anthrazitfarbenen Jacke cremefarbenen Strick mit einer weiten cremefarbenen Hose. Braune Rippensocken und Pennyloafer geben Halt; ein feines goldfarbenes Armband ergänzt den Look."},"items":["bd15-15-minimal-m.outer","bd15-15-minimal-m.top","bd15-15-minimal-m.bottom","bd15-15-minimal-m.shoes","bd15-15-minimal-m.socks","bd15-15-minimal-m.jewelry"],"article":{"title":"CREAM, GROUNDED","intro":{"ko":"차콜 울 재킷 아래 크림 니트와 크림 와이드 팬츠를 이어 입어요. 브라운 리브 삭스와 페니 로퍼로 발끝을 묶고 가는 골드 톤 브레이슬릿을 더해요.","en":"Connect cream knitwear to cream wide trousers beneath a charcoal jacket. Anchor the look with brown rib socks and penny loafers, then add a fine gold-tone bracelet.","de":"Verbinde unter der anthrazitfarbenen Jacke cremefarbenen Strick mit einer weiten cremefarbenen Hose. Braune Rippensocken und Pennyloafer geben Halt; ein feines goldfarbenes Armband ergänzt den Look."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-01-run-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"run","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Female/35+/day/01-running.jpg","deck":{"ko":"코발트 셸 하나, 나머지는 차콜과 블랙.","en":"One cobalt shell. Everything else in charcoal and black.","de":"Eine kobaltblaue Jacke. Dazu Anthrazit und Schwarz."},"items":["bd15-01-run-f.01-outer","bd15-01-run-f.02-top","bd15-01-run-f.03-bottom","bd15-01-run-f.04-hands","bd15-01-run-f.05-socks","bd15-01-run-f.06-shoes","bd15-01-run-f.07-headwear"],"article":{"title":"BLUE IN MOTION","intro":{"ko":"선명한 블루 셸에 차콜 크루넥과 블랙 타이츠를 겹쳐요. 헤드밴드와 장갑은 블랙으로 연결하고, 아이보리 삭스와 그레이 러너로 발끝만 밝게 마무리해요.","en":"Layer a vivid blue shell over a charcoal crew neck and black tights. Keep headband and gloves black, then lighten the finish with ivory socks and grey runners.","de":"Kombiniere eine kräftig blaue Jacke mit einem anthrazitfarbenen Rundhalsshirt und schwarzen Tights. Stirnband und Handschuhe bleiben schwarz; elfenbeinfarbene Socken und graue Laufschuhe setzen einen hellen Abschluss."},"pull":"ONE BOLD LAYER. KEEP MOVING."}},
    {"id":"bd15-02-run-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"run","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Female/35+/day/02-running.jpg","deck":{"ko":"샌드와 네이비, 출발을 가볍게.","en":"Sand and navy. An easy start.","de":"Sand und Marineblau. Ein entspannter Start."},"items":["bd15-02-run-f.01-outer","bd15-02-run-f.02-top","bd15-02-run-f.03-bottom","bd15-02-run-f.04-hands","bd15-02-run-f.05-socks","bd15-02-run-f.06-shoes"],"article":{"title":"SOFT START","intro":{"ko":"샌드 셸 아래 짙은 네이비를 길게 이어줘요. 여유 있는 러닝 팬츠의 밑단을 정돈하고, 그레이 삭스와 밝은 메쉬 러너로 발끝을 가볍게 마무리해요.","en":"Run dark navy beneath a sand shell. Keep the tapered trousers neat at the ankle, then finish with grey socks and pale mesh runners.","de":"Kombiniere eine sandfarbene Jacke mit dunklem Marineblau. Halte die schmal zulaufende Hose am Knöchel ordentlich und ergänze graue Socken sowie helle Mesh-Laufschuhe."},"pull":"QUIET TONES. A CLEAR START."}},
    {"id":"bd15-03-run-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"run","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Female/35+/day/03-running.jpg","deck":{"ko":"포레스트 그린 위로, 차콜과 블랙의 리듬.","en":"Forest green, grounded in charcoal and black.","de":"Waldgrün, geerdet durch Anthrazit und Schwarz."},"items":["bd15-03-run-f.01-outer","bd15-03-run-f.02-top","bd15-03-run-f.03-bottom","bd15-03-run-f.04-hands","bd15-03-run-f.05-shoes"],"article":{"title":"FOREST PACE","intro":{"ko":"딥 그린 셸을 열어 차콜 하프집의 짧은 지퍼 라인을 보여줘요. 블랙 타이츠와 글러브로 실루엣을 정리하고 그레이 러너로 밝기를 조금 더해요.","en":"Open the deep green shell to reveal the charcoal half-zip. Black tights and gloves keep the silhouette controlled, while grey runners add a lighter finish.","de":"Öffne die tiefgrüne Jacke, damit der kurze Reißverschluss des anthrazitfarbenen Shirts sichtbar wird. Schwarze Tights und Handschuhe halten den Look klar; graue Laufschuhe hellen ihn auf."},"pull":"DEEP GREEN. STEADY RHYTHM."}},
    {"id":"bd15-04-run-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"run","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Female/35+/day/04-running.jpg","deck":{"ko":"코랄과 버건디, 올리브로 마무리하는 한 걸음.","en":"Coral over burgundy, finished in olive.","de":"Koralle über Burgunder, abgerundet mit Oliv."},"items":["bd15-04-run-f.01-outer","bd15-04-run-f.02-top","bd15-04-run-f.03-bottom","bd15-04-run-f.04-socks","bd15-04-run-f.05-shoes"],"article":{"title":"CORAL STRIDE","intro":{"ko":"코랄 셸과 버건디 이너를 겹쳐 따뜻한 색의 깊이를 만들어요. 긴 커프를 소매 밖으로 드러내고, 슬레이트 타이츠와 아이보리 삭스 사이에 올리브 러너를 더해요.","en":"Layer coral over burgundy for depth within a warm palette. Let the long cuffs extend past the shell sleeves, then add slate tights, ivory socks and olive runners.","de":"Schichte Koralle über Burgunder für Tiefe in einer warmen Farbpalette. Lasse die langen Bündchen unter der Jacke hervorschauen und ergänze schiefergraue Tights, elfenbeinfarbene Socken und olivgrüne Laufschuhe."},"pull":"WARM COLOUR. EASY MOVEMENT."}},
    {"id":"bd15-05-run-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"run","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Female/35+/day/05-running.jpg","deck":{"ko":"네이비의 차분함에 오렌지 한 모금.","en":"Calm navy. One bright orange accent.","de":"Ruhiges Marineblau. Ein leuchtend orangefarbener Akzent."},"items":["bd15-05-run-f.01-outer","bd15-05-run-f.02-top","bd15-05-run-f.03-bottom","bd15-05-run-f.04-hands","bd15-05-run-f.05-socks","bd15-05-run-f.06-shoes","bd15-05-run-f.07-gear","bd15-05-run-f.08-jewelry"],"article":{"title":"NAVY, WITH A TWIST","intro":{"ko":"네이비 셸과 블루그레이 타이츠를 비슷한 톤으로 연결해요. 아이보리 이너와 그레이 삭스로 틈을 밝히고, 오렌지 보틀과 작은 골드 스터드로 포인트를 더해요.","en":"Link a navy shell to blue-grey tights. Ivory cuffs and grey socks lift the layers, while an orange bottle and tiny gold-tone studs add small accents.","de":"Verbinde eine marineblaue Jacke mit blaugrauen Tights. Elfenbeinfarbene Bündchen und graue Socken lockern die Lagen auf; eine orangefarbene Flasche und kleine goldfarbene Ohrstecker setzen Akzente."},"pull":"TONAL LAYERS. ONE BRIGHT TWIST."}},
    {"id":"bd15-06-street-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Female/35+/day/06-street.jpg","deck":{"ko":"차콜 사이로 시트론 한 겹.","en":"A layer of citron between charcoal and white.","de":"Eine Lage Zitrongelb zwischen Anthrazit und Weiß."},"items":["bd15-06-street-f.01-outer","bd15-06-street-f.02-top","bd15-06-street-f.03-under","bd15-06-street-f.04-bottom","bd15-06-street-f.05-socks","bd15-06-street-f.06-shoes","bd15-06-street-f.07-jewelry","bd15-06-street-f.08-earrings"],"article":{"title":"CAFÉ IN CITRON","intro":{"ko":"차콜 보머 아래 시트론 케이블 니트를 겹치고 화이트 셔츠의 칼라와 커프를 조금 드러내요. 토프 와이드 팬츠와 크림 스니커즈로 부드럽게 이어가고, 작은 골드 톤 주얼리로 마무리해요.","en":"Layer citron cable knit beneath a charcoal bomber, revealing a little white shirt at collar and cuffs. Taupe wide-leg trousers and cream sneakers keep the palette soft; small gold-tone jewellery finishes it.","de":"Trage zitrongelben Zopfstrick unter einer anthrazitfarbenen Bomberjacke und lasse weißen Hemdkragen und Manschetten hervorschauen. Eine taupefarbene weite Hose, cremefarbene Sneaker und kleine goldfarbene Schmuckstücke runden den Look ab."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-07-street-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Female/35+/day/07-street.jpg","deck":{"ko":"브라운의 농도는 다르게, 패턴은 크게.","en":"Different shades of brown. One bold pattern.","de":"Verschiedene Brauntöne. Ein großes Muster."},"items":["bd15-07-street-f.01-outer","bd15-07-street-f.02-top","bd15-07-street-f.03-bottom","bd15-07-street-f.04-shoes","bd15-07-street-f.05-bag","bd15-07-street-f.06-jewelry","bd15-07-street-f.07-earrings"],"article":{"title":"BROWN, WITH A PATTERN","intro":{"ko":"스웨이드의 매트한 표면과 그래픽 팬츠의 큰 패턴을 한 색 계열로 묶어요. 크림 니트를 사이에 두고 화이트 스니커즈로 발끝을 밝히면, 브라운 숄더백까지 자연스럽게 이어져요.","en":"Bring matte suede and a large trouser pattern together through shades of brown. A cream knit and white sneakers lighten the composition, while a chocolate shoulder bag keeps it connected.","de":"Verbinde matte Wildlederoptik und ein großes Hosenmuster durch verschiedene Brauntöne. Cremefarbener Strick und weiße Sneaker hellen den Look auf; eine schokoladenbraune Schultertasche führt die Palette fort."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-08-street-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Female/35+/day/08-street.jpg","deck":{"ko":"레드 보머, 인디고 데님, 브라운 로퍼.","en":"Red bomber. Indigo denim. Brown loafers.","de":"Rote Bomberjacke. Indigojeans. Braune Loafer."},"items":["bd15-08-street-f.01-outer","bd15-08-street-f.02-top","bd15-08-street-f.03-bottom","bd15-08-street-f.04-socks","bd15-08-street-f.05-shoes","bd15-08-street-f.06-bag","bd15-08-street-f.07-jewelry","bd15-08-street-f.08-earrings"],"article":{"title":"RED ON THE BLOCK","intro":{"ko":"레드 보머의 둥근 볼륨을 와이드 인디고 데님으로 받쳐요. 크림 니트와 리브 삭스를 연결하고, 브라운 페니 로퍼와 숄더백으로 선명한 상의 색을 정리해요.","en":"Balance a rounded red bomber with wide indigo denim. Link cream knit to ribbed socks, then ground the vivid jacket with brown penny loafers and a shoulder bag.","de":"Gleiche die runde Form der roten Bomberjacke mit weiten Indigojeans aus. Verbinde cremefarbenen Strick mit Rippensocken und erde die kräftige Jacke durch braune Pennyloafer und eine Schultertasche."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-09-street-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Female/35+/day/09-street.jpg","deck":{"ko":"네이비와 올리브 사이, 길게 떨어지는 버건디.","en":"A long burgundy line between navy and olive.","de":"Eine lange burgunderfarbene Linie zwischen Marineblau und Oliv."},"items":["bd15-09-street-f.01-outer","bd15-09-street-f.02-top","bd15-09-street-f.03-under","bd15-09-street-f.04-bottom","bd15-09-street-f.05-scarf","bd15-09-street-f.06-bag","bd15-09-street-f.07-shoes","bd15-09-street-f.08-earrings","bd15-09-street-f.09-ring"],"article":{"title":"BURGUNDY AT THE DOOR","intro":{"ko":"짧은 네이비 재킷 안에 화이트 셔츠와 오트밀 니트를 겹쳐요. 버건디 머플러를 길게 늘어뜨려 올리브 팬츠의 넉넉한 실루엣과 연결하고, 실버 러너와 작은 크로스바디로 가볍게 마무리해요.","en":"Layer a white shirt and oatmeal knit inside a short navy jacket. Let a burgundy scarf fall long against generous olive trousers, finishing with silver runners and a small crossbody bag.","de":"Schichte ein weißes Hemd und einen haferfarbenen Pullover unter eine kurze marineblaue Jacke. Lasse den burgunderfarbenen Schal lang über die weite olivgrüne Hose fallen und ergänze silberne Sneaker sowie eine kleine Umhängetasche."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-10-street-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Female/35+/day/10-street.jpg","deck":{"ko":"퀼팅, 니트, 코듀로이. 부드러운 표면을 겹쳐요.","en":"Quilting, knit and corduroy. Softness in layers.","de":"Steppung, Strick und Cord. Weiche Texturen in Schichten."},"items":["bd15-10-street-f.01-outer","bd15-10-street-f.02-top","bd15-10-street-f.03-bottom","bd15-10-street-f.04-scarf","bd15-10-street-f.05-earrings","bd15-10-street-f.06-bracelet","bd15-10-street-f.07-bag"],"article":{"title":"SOFT TEXTURE, CITY BREAK","intro":{"ko":"샌드 퀼팅 재킷 안에 차콜 니트를 넣고, 밝은 그레이 머플러를 목에서 길게 이어줘요. 브라운 코듀로이의 굵은 골과 내추럴 캔버스 백으로 소재의 차이를 살리고, 작은 골드 톤 액세서리로 정리해요.","en":"Wear charcoal knit beneath a sand quilted jacket and let a light grey scarf fall long from the neck. Wide-wale brown corduroy and a natural canvas bag add texture, with small gold-tone accessories to finish.","de":"Trage anthrazitfarbenen Strick unter einer sandfarbenen Steppjacke und lasse einen hellgrauen Schal lang fallen. Grober brauner Cord und eine naturfarbene Canvas-Tasche ergänzen Textur; kleine goldfarbene Accessoires runden den Look ab."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-11-minimal-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Female/35+/day/11-minimal.jpg","deck":{"ko":"차콜과 블랙 사이, 크림과 화이트의 얇은 틈.","en":"Cream and white between charcoal and black.","de":"Creme und Weiß zwischen Anthrazit und Schwarz."},"items":["bd15-11-minimal-f.01-outer","bd15-11-minimal-f.02-top","bd15-11-minimal-f.03-under","bd15-11-minimal-f.04-bottom","bd15-11-minimal-f.05-socks","bd15-11-minimal-f.06-shoes","bd15-11-minimal-f.07-jewelry","bd15-11-minimal-f.08-earrings"],"article":{"title":"CREAM BETWEEN CHARCOAL","intro":{"ko":"차콜 재킷 안에 크림 니트와 화이트 셔츠를 겹쳐요. 칼라와 커프, 밑단에서 셔츠를 조금씩 보여주고 블랙 팬츠·삭스·로퍼로 아래를 길게 연결해요.","en":"Layer cream knit and a white shirt beneath charcoal tailoring. Reveal small edges of collar, cuff and hem, then continue black trousers into black socks and loafers.","de":"Schichte cremefarbenen Strick und ein weißes Hemd unter einen anthrazitfarbenen Blazer. Zeige kleine Partien von Kragen, Manschetten und Saum und verbinde schwarze Hose, Socken und Loafer."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-12-minimal-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Female/35+/day/12-minimal.jpg","deck":{"ko":"토프와 초콜릿 사이에 코발트 한 면.","en":"One panel of cobalt between taupe and chocolate.","de":"Eine Fläche Kobaltblau zwischen Taupe und Schokoladenbraun."},"items":["bd15-12-minimal-f.01-outer","bd15-12-minimal-f.02-top","bd15-12-minimal-f.03-bottom","bd15-12-minimal-f.04-socks","bd15-12-minimal-f.05-shoes","bd15-12-minimal-f.06-jewelry","bd15-12-minimal-f.07-earrings"],"article":{"title":"COBALT, QUIETLY","intro":{"ko":"토프 코트를 열어 코발트 니트를 선명하게 보여줘요. 초콜릿 팬츠와 브라운 삭스, 다크 브라운 레이스업을 비슷한 농도로 맞추고 작은 코인 펜던트로 마무리해요.","en":"Open the taupe coat to show a clear panel of cobalt knit. Keep chocolate trousers, brown socks and dark lace-ups close in tone, finishing with a small coin pendant.","de":"Öffne den taupefarbenen Mantel über kräftigem Kobaltblau. Halte schokoladenbraune Hose, braune Socken und dunkle Schnürschuhe tonal nah beieinander und ergänze einen kleinen Münzanhänger."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-13-minimal-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Female/35+/day/13-minimal.jpg","deck":{"ko":"네이비, 그레이, 아이보리. 색보다 부드러운 표면.","en":"Navy, grey and ivory. Texture leads.","de":"Marineblau, Grau und Elfenbein. Die Textur gibt den Ton an."},"items":["bd15-13-minimal-f.01-outer","bd15-13-minimal-f.02-top","bd15-13-minimal-f.03-scarf","bd15-13-minimal-f.04-bottom","bd15-13-minimal-f.05-socks","bd15-13-minimal-f.06-shoes","bd15-13-minimal-f.07-earrings","bd15-13-minimal-f.08-ring","bd15-13-minimal-f.09-bracelet","bd15-13-minimal-f.10-nose-ring"],"article":{"title":"NAVY IN SOFT FOCUS","intro":{"ko":"네이비 코트 안에 아이보리 터틀넥을 넣고 그레이 머플러를 길게 떨어뜨려요. 차콜 와이드 팬츠와 어두운 삭스·로퍼로 흐름을 이어가고, 얇은 골드 톤 주얼리만 더해요.","en":"Wear an ivory turtleneck beneath navy and let a grey scarf fall long. Charcoal wide-leg trousers flow into dark socks and loafers; fine gold-tone jewellery keeps the accents small.","de":"Trage einen elfenbeinfarbenen Rollkragen unter Marineblau und lasse den grauen Schal lang fallen. Eine weite anthrazitfarbene Hose geht in dunkle Socken und Loafer über; feiner goldfarbener Schmuck setzt kleine Akzente."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-14-minimal-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Female/35+/day/14-minimal.jpg","deck":{"ko":"카멜과 브라운 위로, 길게 이어지는 레드.","en":"A long line of red over camel and brown.","de":"Eine lange rote Linie über Camel und Braun."},"items":["bd15-14-minimal-f.01-outer","bd15-14-minimal-f.02-top","bd15-14-minimal-f.03-bottom","bd15-14-minimal-f.04-scarf","bd15-14-minimal-f.05-bag","bd15-14-minimal-f.06-shoes","bd15-14-minimal-f.07-jewelry","bd15-14-minimal-f.08-earrings"],"article":{"title":"A LINE OF RED","intro":{"ko":"카멜 크롭 재킷과 브라운 턴업 팬츠를 차콜 니트로 연결해요. 얇은 레드 스카프를 길게 두르고 다크 브라운 숄더백과 앵클부츠로 톤을 정리해요.","en":"Link a cropped camel jacket and brown turn-up trousers with charcoal knit. Let a lightweight red scarf fall long, then ground the palette with a dark brown bag and ankle boots.","de":"Verbinde eine kurze camelfarbene Jacke und braune Umschlaghosen durch anthrazitfarbenen Strick. Lasse einen leichten roten Schal lang fallen und ergänze eine dunkelbraune Tasche sowie Ankle-Boots."}}},
    {"id":"bd15-15-minimal-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"clear","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Sunny/Chilly/Female/35+/day/15-minimal.jpg","deck":{"ko":"크림 레이어에 코코아와 에스프레소 한 톤.","en":"Cream layers, finished in cocoa and espresso.","de":"Cremefarbene Lagen, abgerundet mit Kakao und Espresso."},"items":["bd15-15-minimal-f.01-outer","bd15-15-minimal-f.02-top","bd15-15-minimal-f.03-bottom","bd15-15-minimal-f.04-socks","bd15-15-minimal-f.05-shoes","bd15-15-minimal-f.06-earrings","bd15-15-minimal-f.07-ring"],"article":{"title":"CREAM, WITH COFFEE","intro":{"ko":"차콜 코트 아래 아이보리 니트와 오프화이트 팬츠를 이어 밝은 면을 만들어요. 코코아 삭스와 에스프레소 로퍼로 발끝을 짙게 정리하고 작은 후프와 얇은 링만 더해요.","en":"Create a pale panel with ivory knit and off-white trousers beneath a charcoal coat. Cocoa socks and espresso loafers deepen the finish, with small hoops and one slim ring.","de":"Bilde mit elfenbeinfarbenem Strick und einer offwhitefarbenen Hose eine helle Fläche unter dem anthrazitfarbenen Mantel. Kakaobraune Socken und espressobraune Loafer setzen einen dunklen Abschluss, ergänzt durch kleine Creolen und einen schmalen Ring."}}},
    {"id":"oc15-01-run-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"run","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/day/01-running/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"오버캐스트 강변, 오버진 위로 은색 라인. 발목엔 라임 한 점.","en":"Overcast riverside: silver lines over aubergine, a dash of lime at the ankle.","de":"Grauer Uferweg: Silberlinien auf Aubergine, ein Hauch Limette am Knöchel."},"article":{"title":"RUN THE GRAY","intro":{"ko":"하늘이 낮게 내려앉은 날엔 색을 많이 쓰지 않아도 돼요. 어두운 아노락과 여유 있는 조거를 바탕으로, 발목의 라임과 은색 디테일만 또렷하게 남겨요.","en":"When the sky hangs low, you don't need much colour. A dark anorak and roomy joggers set the base; only the lime at the ankle and the silver details stand out.","de":"Wenn der Himmel tief hängt, braucht es wenig Farbe. Dunkler Anorak und weite Jogger bilden die Basis; nur Limette am Knöchel und die Silberdetails stechen heraus."},"pull":"KEEP THE PACE. KEEP IT LIGHT.","tip":{"ko":"달리며 더워지면 하프집을 조금 열고, 장갑부터 조절해 보세요.","en":"If you warm up on the run, open the half-zip a little and adjust the gloves first.","de":"Wird es beim Laufen warm, den Half-Zip etwas öffnen und zuerst die Handschuhe anpassen."}},"items":["oc15-01-run-m.01-outer","oc15-01-run-m.02-top","oc15-01-run-m.03-bottom","oc15-01-run-m.04-hands","oc15-01-run-m.05-socks","oc15-01-run-m.06-shoes"]},
    {"id":"oc15-02-run-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"run","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/day/02-running/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"번트 오렌지 베스트, 검은 소매. 출발 전 손목을 확인하는 순간.","en":"A burnt-orange vest, black sleeves. The moment you check your wrist before heading out.","de":"Weste in Brandorange, schwarze Ärmel. Der Blick aufs Handgelenk vor dem Start."},"article":{"title":"CHECK IN. HEAD OUT.","intro":{"ko":"팔은 가볍게, 몸통엔 한 겹 더. 베스트와 롱슬리브를 나눠 입고 쇼츠 아래에 타이츠를 겹치면, 러닝 룩에도 분명한 층이 생겨요.","en":"Light on the arms, one more layer on the body. Split vest and long sleeve, layer tights under shorts, and even a running look gets clear layers.","de":"Leicht an den Armen, eine Schicht mehr am Körper. Weste und Langarm getrennt, Tights unter den Shorts: So bekommt auch ein Lauf-Look klare Lagen."},"pull":"ONE LAYER. MORE OPTIONS.","tip":{"ko":"기록 확인은 멈춰서 짧게. 다시 움직일 때는 시선을 앞에 두세요.","en":"Check your time briefly while standing still. When you move again, keep your eyes ahead.","de":"Die Zeit kurz im Stehen checken. Beim Weiterlaufen den Blick nach vorn."}},"items":["oc15-02-run-m.01-outer","oc15-02-run-m.02-top","oc15-02-run-m.03-shorts","oc15-02-run-m.04-bottom","oc15-02-run-m.05-hands","oc15-02-run-m.06-shoes","oc15-02-run-m.07-eyewear","oc15-02-run-m.08-watch"]},
    {"id":"oc15-03-run-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"run","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/day/03-running/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"차가운 블루 셸 아래, 버건디 양말이 살짝 보이는 러닝 룩.","en":"An icy blue shell, with burgundy socks peeking out underneath.","de":"Eisblaue Shell, darunter blitzen bordeauxrote Socken hervor."},"article":{"title":"ICE BLUE, OFF BEAT","intro":{"ko":"회색 하늘과 닮은 아이스 블루를 크게 쓰고, 짙은 그레이로 아래를 받쳐요. 버건디 양말은 가까이서 봤을 때 발견되는 작은 반전이에요.","en":"Go big on an ice blue that echoes the grey sky and ground it with dark grey. The burgundy socks are a small twist you only notice up close.","de":"Viel Eisblau, das zum grauen Himmel passt, unten von dunklem Grau getragen. Die bordeauxroten Socken sind die kleine Wendung, die man erst aus der Nähe sieht."},"pull":"COOL COLOR. EASY MOVEMENT.","tip":{"ko":"얇은 겉옷 아래 이너는 한 겹만 간결하게 맞춰요.","en":"Keep just one simple layer under a thin shell.","de":"Unter einer dünnen Jacke nur eine schlichte Schicht."}},"items":["oc15-03-run-m.01-outer","oc15-03-run-m.02-top","oc15-03-run-m.03-bottom","oc15-03-run-m.04-socks","oc15-03-run-m.05-shoes","oc15-03-run-m.06-headwear","oc15-03-run-m.07-hands"]},
    {"id":"oc15-04-run-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"run","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/day/04-running/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"모스 그린과 버건디. 회색 골목에 차분한 두 가지 색.","en":"Moss green and burgundy. Two calm colours in a grey side street.","de":"Moosgrün und Bordeaux. Zwei ruhige Farben in einer grauen Seitenstraße."},"article":{"title":"TURN THE CORNER","intro":{"ko":"초록과 와인을 함께 쓰되 채도는 낮춰요. 검은 팬츠가 두 색을 묶어주고, 연노랑 신발은 마지막에 가벼운 밝기만 보태요.","en":"Wear green and wine together, but keep them muted. Black trousers tie the two colours together, and pale yellow shoes add a final touch of light.","de":"Grün und Weinrot zusammen, aber gedämpft. Die schwarze Hose verbindet beide Farben, blassgelbe Schuhe bringen zum Schluss etwas Helligkeit."},"pull":"MUTED DOESN’T MEAN QUIET.","tip":{"ko":"겹쳐 입는 수보다 움직이기 편한 조합을 먼저 생각해요.","en":"Think about ease of movement before the number of layers.","de":"Erst an Bewegungsfreiheit denken, dann an die Zahl der Schichten."}},"items":["oc15-04-run-m.01-outer","oc15-04-run-m.02-top","oc15-04-run-m.03-bottom","oc15-04-run-m.04-hands","oc15-04-run-m.05-shoes","oc15-04-run-m.06-watch"]},
    {"id":"oc15-05-run-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"run","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/day/05-running/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"실버 베스트와 플럼 팬츠. 멈춘 순간에도 이어지는 라인.","en":"A silver vest and plum trousers. The line carries on even when you stop.","de":"Silberne Weste und pflaumenfarbene Hose. Die Linie bleibt, auch wenn du stehst."},"article":{"title":"PAUSE BY THE WATER","intro":{"ko":"회색 베스트는 넓게, 플럼은 아래에 길게. 검은 이너와 장갑을 사이에 넣어 색의 간격을 정리해요. 달리기 전후의 잠깐 멈춤에도 어울리는 조합이에요.","en":"Grey vest wide on top, plum long below. A black base layer and gloves space the colours out. It works for the pause before or after a run, too.","de":"Graue Weste oben, Pflaume lang darunter. Schwarzes Shirt und Handschuhe ordnen die Farben. Passt auch für die Pause vor oder nach dem Lauf."},"pull":"A PAUSE IS PART OF THE RUN.","tip":{"ko":"오래 멈춰 있을 땐 젖은 이너 상태와 추위를 확인하고 겉옷을 조절하세요.","en":"If you stand still for long, check whether your base layer is damp and you're getting cold, and adjust the outer layer.","de":"Bei längeren Pausen prüfen, ob das Shirt feucht ist und du auskühlst, und die äußere Schicht anpassen."}},"items":["oc15-05-run-m.01-outer","oc15-05-run-m.02-top","oc15-05-run-m.03-bottom","oc15-05-run-m.04-hands","oc15-05-run-m.05-shoes"]},
    {"id":"oc15-06-street-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"street","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/day/06-street/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"레코드를 넘기는 손끝. 블랙 레더 안에 더스티 핑크 한 겹.","en":"Fingertips flicking through records. A layer of dusty pink inside black leather.","de":"Fingerspitzen zwischen Schallplatten. Eine Schicht Altrosa unter schwarzem Leder."},"article":{"title":"DIG FOR SOMETHING GOOD","intro":{"ko":"박시한 가죽 재킷에 폭 넓은 데님을 붙이면 상하의 비율이 느긋해져요. 안쪽의 핑크와 발끝의 옥스블러드는 작은 면적으로만 남겨요.","en":"A boxy leather jacket over wide denim relaxes the proportions. Keep the pink inside and the oxblood at your feet to small areas.","de":"Eine kastige Lederjacke zu weitem Denim entspannt die Proportionen. Rosa innen und Ochsenblut an den Füßen bleiben kleine Flächen."},"pull":"GOOD FINDS TAKE THEIR TIME.","tip":{"ko":"상의와 하의가 모두 넓을 땐 이너 밑단을 짧게 정리해요.","en":"When top and bottom are both wide, keep the hem of the inner layer short.","de":"Sind Ober- und Unterteil weit, den Saum der inneren Schicht kurz halten."}},"items":["oc15-06-street-m.01-outer","oc15-06-street-m.02-top","oc15-06-street-m.03-bottom","oc15-06-street-m.04-shoes","oc15-06-street-m.05-jewelry"]},
    {"id":"oc15-07-street-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"street","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/day/07-street/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"짧은 머스터드 재킷, 넉넉한 브라운 팬츠. 장보기에도 자기만의 비율.","en":"A short mustard jacket, roomy brown trousers. Your own proportions, even for the shopping run.","de":"Kurze Senfjacke, weite braune Hose. Eigene Proportionen, auch beim Einkaufen."},"article":{"title":"TAKE THE LONG WAY","intro":{"ko":"상의는 짧고 하의는 둥글게. 머스터드와 초콜릿 사이에 네이비를 넣으면 따뜻한 색들이 지나치게 달아지지 않아요. 모브 머플러로 목 주변을 부드럽게 정리해요.","en":"Short on top, rounded below. Navy between mustard and chocolate keeps the warm colours from getting too sweet. A mauve scarf softens the neckline.","de":"Oben kurz, unten rund. Navy zwischen Senf und Schokolade verhindert, dass die warmen Töne zu süß werden. Ein Schal in Mauve macht den Hals weicher."},"pull":"MAKE THE ERRAND YOUR OWN.","tip":{"ko":"머플러는 한 번만 가볍게 감아 짧은 재킷의 선을 살려요.","en":"Wrap the scarf just once, loosely, to keep the short jacket's line.","de":"Den Schal nur einmal locker wickeln, damit die kurze Jacke ihre Linie behält."}},"items":["oc15-07-street-m.01-outer","oc15-07-street-m.02-top","oc15-07-street-m.03-bottom","oc15-07-street-m.04-shoes","oc15-07-street-m.05-scarf","oc15-07-street-m.06-bag","oc15-07-street-m.07-eyewear"]},
    {"id":"oc15-08-street-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"street","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/day/08-street/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"트램을 기다리는 사이. 라일락 체크와 투박한 부츠의 조합.","en":"Waiting for the tram. Lilac check with chunky boots.","de":"Warten auf die Tram. Flieder-Karo zu derben Boots."},"article":{"title":"WAIT WITH ATTITUDE","intro":{"ko":"큼직한 체크를 주인공으로 두고, 목부터 데님까지 짙게 이어줘요. 밝은 부츠가 낮은 앵글에서 무게중심을 만들고, 캡은 전체를 조금 더 편하게 풀어줘요.","en":"Let the big check lead and keep it dark from neck to denim. Light boots set the centre of gravity low, and a cap loosens the whole look.","de":"Das große Karo führt, vom Hals bis zum Denim bleibt es dunkel. Helle Boots setzen den Schwerpunkt tief, eine Cap macht alles lockerer."},"pull":"THE WAIT IS PART OF THE DAY.","tip":{"ko":"체크가 큰 날엔 이너와 액세서리의 패턴을 쉬게 해요.","en":"On a big-check day, give the inner layer and accessories a rest from pattern.","de":"Bei großem Karo dürfen Shirt und Accessoires ohne Muster bleiben."}},"items":["oc15-08-street-m.01-outer","oc15-08-street-m.02-top","oc15-08-street-m.03-bottom","oc15-08-street-m.04-shoes","oc15-08-street-m.05-headwear"]},
    {"id":"oc15-09-street-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"street","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/day/09-street/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"올리브 파카와 워싱 데님. 옐로 비니 아래 느긋한 점심.","en":"An olive parka and washed denim. A slow lunch under a yellow beanie.","de":"Olivfarbener Parka und gewaschener Denim. Entspannte Mittagspause unter gelber Mütze."},"article":{"title":"LUNCH BREAK, NO RUSH","intro":{"ko":"여유 있는 파카와 둥근 데님은 편하게 입을수록 멋이 나요. 머리엔 노랑, 발목엔 러스트를 조금씩. 나머지는 바랜 색으로 이어주세요.","en":"A roomy parka and rounded denim look best worn easy. Yellow on the head, a little rust at the ankle, faded colours for the rest.","de":"Ein weiter Parka und runder Denim wirken am besten locker getragen. Gelb am Kopf, etwas Rost am Knöchel, der Rest in verwaschenen Tönen."},"pull":"DRESS FOR THE DETOUR.","tip":{"ko":"파카를 열어 밝은 이너가 보이게 하면 긴 실루엣도 가벼워져요.","en":"Open the parka to show the light layer underneath and the long silhouette feels lighter.","de":"Den Parka öffnen, damit die helle Schicht darunter zu sehen ist: So wirkt die lange Silhouette leichter."}},"items":["oc15-09-street-m.01-outer","oc15-09-street-m.02-top","oc15-09-street-m.03-bottom","oc15-09-street-m.04-socks","oc15-09-street-m.05-shoes","oc15-09-street-m.06-headwear"]},
    {"id":"oc15-10-street-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"street","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/day/10-street/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"버건디 퀼팅과 굵은 스트라이프. 자전거 옆의 일상적인 조합.","en":"Burgundy quilting and bold stripes. An everyday pairing next to the bike.","de":"Bordeaux-Steppung und breite Streifen. Ein Alltags-Look neben dem Fahrrad."},"article":{"title":"LOCK UP. STEP OUT.","intro":{"ko":"짧은 퀼팅 재킷과 길게 떨어지는 울 느낌의 팬츠를 섞어요. 캐주얼한 줄무늬와 은색 러너가 정장 같은 무게를 덜어줘요.","en":"Mix a short quilted jacket with long, wool-like trousers. Casual stripes and silver runners take away any suit-like heaviness.","de":"Eine kurze Steppjacke zu einer langen Hose mit Wollanmutung. Lässige Streifen und silberne Runner nehmen jede Anzugsschwere."},"pull":"A LITTLE TEXTURE GOES FAR.","tip":{"ko":"재킷과 팬츠의 길이 차이를 살리고, 가방은 부드러운 형태로 골라요.","en":"Play up the length difference between jacket and trousers, and pick a soft bag.","de":"Den Längenunterschied zwischen Jacke und Hose betonen, dazu eine weiche Tasche."}},"items":["oc15-10-street-m.01-outer","oc15-10-street-m.02-top","oc15-10-street-m.03-bottom","oc15-10-street-m.04-shoes","oc15-10-street-m.05-bag"]},
    {"id":"oc15-11-minimal-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/day/11-minimal/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"짧은 더블 재킷과 넓은 스톤 팬츠. 선명한 비율만 남기기.","en":"A short double-breasted jacket and wide stone trousers. Keep only clear proportions.","de":"Kurzes Zweireiher-Sakko und weite steinfarbene Hose. Nur klare Proportionen bleiben."},"article":{"title":"CUT TO THE ESSENTIALS","intro":{"ko":"짙은 상체와 밝은 하체를 분명히 나눠요. 장식은 소매 옆의 얇은 은색 선 하나면 충분해요. 신발까지 직선적인 형태로 마무리해요.","en":"Split a dark top and a light bottom cleanly. One thin silver line at the sleeve is all the decoration you need. Finish with straight-lined shoes.","de":"Dunkel oben und hell unten klar trennen. Eine dünne Silberlinie am Ärmel reicht als Schmuck. Zum Schluss Schuhe mit geraden Linien."},"pull":"LESS COLOR. CLEARER SHAPE.","tip":{"ko":"소매 길이를 맞추면 재킷의 짧은 비율이 더 단정해져요.","en":"Get the sleeve length right and the short jacket looks even neater.","de":"Stimmt die Ärmellänge, wirkt die kurze Jacke noch ordentlicher."}},"items":["oc15-11-minimal-m.01-outer","oc15-11-minimal-m.02-top","oc15-11-minimal-m.03-bottom","oc15-11-minimal-m.04-shoes","oc15-11-minimal-m.05-jewelry"]},
    {"id":"oc15-12-minimal-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/day/12-minimal/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"초콜릿 재킷 안에 라벤더. 조용하지만 평범하지 않은 배색.","en":"Lavender inside a chocolate jacket. Quiet, but not ordinary.","de":"Lavendel unter einer schokobraunen Jacke. Ruhig, aber nicht gewöhnlich."},"article":{"title":"SOFT CONTRAST","intro":{"ko":"칼라 없는 재킷은 목 주변을 간결하게 만들어요. 라벤더를 넓지 않게 드러내고 검은 팬츠로 아래를 눌러주면, 색은 부드럽고 실루엣은 또렷해져요.","en":"A collarless jacket keeps the neckline clean. Show only a little lavender and anchor it with black trousers: soft colour, sharp silhouette.","de":"Eine kragenlose Jacke hält den Hals schlicht. Nur etwas Lavendel zeigen und mit schwarzer Hose erden: weiche Farbe, klare Silhouette."},"pull":"LET ONE COLOR BREATHE.","tip":{"ko":"이너의 색을 보여줄 만큼만 재킷을 열어 입어요.","en":"Open the jacket just enough to show the colour underneath.","de":"Die Jacke nur so weit öffnen, dass die Farbe darunter zu sehen ist."}},"items":["oc15-12-minimal-m.01-outer","oc15-12-minimal-m.02-top","oc15-12-minimal-m.03-bottom","oc15-12-minimal-m.04-shoes"]},
    {"id":"oc15-13-minimal-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/day/13-minimal/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"회색 트렌치가 움직이는 순간. 발끝에만 버건디.","en":"A grey trench in motion. Burgundy only at your feet.","de":"Ein grauer Trench in Bewegung. Bordeaux nur an den Füßen."},"article":{"title":"IN BETWEEN STOPS","intro":{"ko":"긴 트렌치의 선 안에 검정을 길게 이어줘요. 걷거나 돌아설 때 코트가 벌어지며 안쪽 실루엣이 드러나요. 버건디 부츠로 낮은 위치에 색을 남겨요.","en":"Run black long inside the line of a long trench. As you walk or turn, the coat opens and shows the silhouette inside. Burgundy boots keep the colour low.","de":"Schwarz lang innerhalb der Linie eines langen Trenchs. Beim Gehen oder Drehen öffnet sich der Mantel und zeigt die Silhouette. Bordeaux-Boots halten die Farbe tief."},"pull":"LET THE COAT MOVE.","tip":{"ko":"트렌치 벨트와 끈은 걸리지 않도록 정리해요.","en":"Tidy the trench belt and ties so they don't catch.","de":"Gürtel und Bänder des Trenchs ordnen, damit nichts hängen bleibt."}},"items":["oc15-13-minimal-m.01-outer","oc15-13-minimal-m.02-top","oc15-13-minimal-m.03-bottom","oc15-13-minimal-m.04-shoes","oc15-13-minimal-m.05-eyewear"]},
    {"id":"oc15-14-minimal-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/day/14-minimal/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"스톤 니트와 토바코 팬츠 사이, 작은 옐로 파우치.","en":"Between stone knit and tobacco trousers, a small yellow pouch.","de":"Zwischen steinfarbenem Strick und tabakbrauner Hose: eine kleine gelbe Tasche."},"article":{"title":"A SMALL SHOT OF YELLOW","intro":{"ko":"부드러운 중간색을 넓게 쓰고 밝은 노랑은 가방 하나에만 남겨요. 발목의 회색 양말과 검은 로퍼가 느긋한 착장을 단정하게 마무리해줘요.","en":"Use soft mid-tones widely and save bright yellow for one bag. Grey socks at the ankle and black loafers finish the relaxed look neatly.","de":"Weiche Mitteltöne großflächig, helles Gelb nur für eine Tasche. Graue Socken und schwarze Loafer schließen den lockeren Look ordentlich ab."},"pull":"SMALL BAG. BIG DIFFERENCE.","tip":{"ko":"볼드한 색을 하나 쓸 땐 나머지 면을 차분하게 비워둬요.","en":"When you wear one bold colour, keep everything else calm.","de":"Bei einer kräftigen Farbe den Rest ruhig lassen."}},"items":["oc15-14-minimal-m.01-outer","oc15-14-minimal-m.02-top","oc15-14-minimal-m.03-bottom","oc15-14-minimal-m.04-socks","oc15-14-minimal-m.05-shoes","oc15-14-minimal-m.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"oc15-15-minimal-m","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/day/15-minimal/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"페트롤과 차콜, 손끝의 작은 실버. 흐린 낮에 어울리는 깊은 색.","en":"Petrol and charcoal, a little silver at the fingertips. Deep colours for a grey day.","de":"Petrol und Anthrazit, etwas Silber an den Fingern. Tiefe Farben für einen grauen Tag."},"article":{"title":"DARK TONES, DAYLIGHT","intro":{"ko":"짙은 청록은 검정 곁에서 천천히 보여요. 재킷과 니트는 어둡게 묶고 팬츠만 한 단계 밝게. 손의 작은 움직임에서 은색 링이 드러나요.","en":"Deep teal reveals itself slowly next to black. Keep jacket and knit dark and the trousers one step lighter. A silver ring shows in small hand movements.","de":"Tiefes Petrol zeigt sich neben Schwarz erst langsam. Jacke und Strick dunkel, die Hose eine Stufe heller. Ein Silberring blitzt bei kleinen Handbewegungen."},"pull":"DETAILS REWARD A CLOSER LOOK.","tip":{"ko":"짙은 색끼리 입을 땐 색보다 표면의 차이를 살려요.","en":"When you wear dark colours together, play with texture rather than colour.","de":"Bei dunklen Tönen lieber mit Oberflächen spielen als mit Farbe."}},"items":["oc15-15-minimal-m.01-outer","oc15-15-minimal-m.02-top","oc15-15-minimal-m.03-bottom","oc15-15-minimal-m.04-shoes"]},
    {"id":"of15-01-run-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"run","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/day/01-running/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"회색 코트 위로 라즈베리 한 면. 시선은 앞으로.","en":"A plane of raspberry over a grey coat. Eyes ahead.","de":"Eine Fläche Himbeere über grauem Mantel. Blick nach vorn."},"article":{"title":"MOVE THROUGH THE GRAY","intro":{"ko":"라즈베리 베스트를 중심으로 네이비 소매와 검은 팬츠를 붙여요. 다리는 여유 있게, 발끝은 실버로. 색은 분명하지만 움직임은 편안하게 남겨요.","en":"Build around a raspberry vest with navy sleeves and black trousers. Roomy legs, silver at the feet. The colour is clear, the movement stays easy.","de":"Rund um eine himbeerrote Weste, dazu Navy-Ärmel und schwarze Hose. Weite Beine, Silber an den Füßen. Klare Farbe, lockere Bewegung."},"pull":"BRIGHT LAYER. CLEAR MIND.","tip":{"ko":"출발 전 손목과 밑단이 움직임을 방해하지 않는지 확인해요.","en":"Before you set off, check that cuffs and hems don't get in the way.","de":"Vor dem Start prüfen, dass Bündchen und Säume nicht stören."}},"items":["of15-01-run-f.01-outer","of15-01-run-f.02-top","of15-01-run-f.03-bottom","of15-01-run-f.04-hands","of15-01-run-f.05-shoes","of15-01-run-f.06-headwear"]},
    {"id":"of15-02-run-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"run","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/day/02-running/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"퓨터 그레이 셸의 민트 배색. 안쪽에는 플럼 한 겹.","en":"Mint panels on a pewter grey shell. A layer of plum inside.","de":"Mintfarbene Einsätze auf zinngrauer Shell. Darunter eine Lage Pflaume."},"article":{"title":"MINT IN THE MIDDLE","intro":{"ko":"반사선과 민트 패널이 회색 셸의 형태를 나눠줘요. 플럼 이너를 목과 손목에 조금 드러내고, 발목에서 민트를 다시 반복해요.","en":"Reflective lines and mint panels break up the grey shell. Show a little plum at neck and wrist, then repeat the mint at the ankle.","de":"Reflexlinien und Mint-Einsätze gliedern die graue Shell. Etwas Pflaume an Hals und Handgelenk, das Mint am Knöchel wiederholen."},"pull":"FIND YOUR OWN COLOR LINE.","tip":{"ko":"소매와 장갑의 겹침을 얇게 정리해 손목을 편하게 해요.","en":"Keep sleeves and gloves thin where they overlap so the wrist stays comfortable.","de":"Ärmel und Handschuhe dünn überlappen lassen, damit das Handgelenk frei bleibt."}},"items":["of15-02-run-f.01-outer","of15-02-run-f.02-top","of15-02-run-f.03-bottom","of15-02-run-f.04-hands","of15-02-run-f.05-socks","of15-02-run-f.06-shoes"]},
    {"id":"of15-03-run-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"run","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/day/03-running/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"러스트 하프집과 올리브 타이츠. 검은 쇼츠로 한 번 끊어주기.","en":"A rust half-zip and olive tights. Black shorts break it up.","de":"Rostfarbener Half-Zip und olive Tights. Schwarze Shorts setzen eine Pause."},"article":{"title":"RUST, READY, GO","intro":{"ko":"따뜻한 러스트와 차분한 올리브를 검정으로 연결해요. 쇼츠와 타이츠를 겹친 하의는 색뿐 아니라 길이 차이도 만들어줘요.","en":"Black links warm rust and calm olive. Shorts over tights add a difference in length as well as colour.","de":"Schwarz verbindet warmes Rost und ruhiges Oliv. Shorts über Tights bringen neben Farbe auch einen Längenunterschied."},"pull":"WARM COLORS. FRESH AIR.","tip":{"ko":"체감 9°C에서도 필요한 겹 수는 운동 강도와 개인차에 맞춰 조절해요.","en":"Even at a feels-like 9°C, adjust the number of layers to your pace and how you feel.","de":"Auch bei gefühlten 9 °C die Zahl der Schichten an Tempo und Empfinden anpassen."}},"items":["of15-03-run-f.01-outer","of15-03-run-f.02-top","of15-03-run-f.03-shorts","of15-03-run-f.04-bottom","of15-03-run-f.05-hands","of15-03-run-f.06-shoes"]},
    {"id":"of15-04-run-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"run","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/day/04-running/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"네이비 베스트 아래 버터빛 소매. 신발 끈을 묶는 짧은 준비.","en":"Butter-coloured sleeves under a navy vest. A moment to lace up.","de":"Butterfarbene Ärmel unter einer Navy-Weste. Kurz die Schuhe schnüren."},"article":{"title":"LACE UP, SLOW DOWN","intro":{"ko":"밝은 이너를 소매 전체에 보여줘요. 네이비와 검정으로 중심을 잡고, 버건디 러너를 발끝에 놓아요. 차분하지만 흔하지 않은 러닝 배색이에요.","en":"Show the light base layer along the whole sleeve. Navy and black hold the centre, burgundy runners sit at your feet. Calm, but not a common running palette.","de":"Das helle Shirt über den ganzen Ärmel zeigen. Navy und Schwarz halten die Mitte, bordeauxrote Runner stehen am Fuß. Ruhig, aber keine alltägliche Lauf-Palette."},"pull":"START WITH THE SMALL THINGS.","tip":{"ko":"끈과 장갑, 밑단을 먼저 정리하고 편하게 출발해요.","en":"Tidy laces, gloves and hems first, then set off at ease.","de":"Erst Schnürsenkel, Handschuhe und Säume ordnen, dann locker loslaufen."}},"items":["of15-04-run-f.01-outer","of15-04-run-f.02-top","of15-04-run-f.03-bottom","of15-04-run-f.04-hands","of15-04-run-f.05-shoes"]},
    {"id":"of15-05-run-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"run","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/day/05-running/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"딥 틸 셸과 와인 레드 이너. 회색 계단 위의 잠깐 쉼.","en":"A deep teal shell and a wine red layer. A short rest on grey steps.","de":"Shell in tiefem Petrol, Shirt in Weinrot. Kurze Pause auf grauen Stufen."},"article":{"title":"TAKE FIVE IN TEAL","intro":{"ko":"짙은 청록과 와인색을 가까이 두고, 바지는 회색으로 편하게 풀어요. 반사 디테일은 가는 선으로 남겨 색과 경쟁하지 않게 해요.","en":"Keep deep teal and wine close and let the trousers relax in grey. Reflective details stay thin lines so they don't compete with the colour.","de":"Tiefes Petrol und Weinrot nah beieinander, die Hose locker in Grau. Reflexdetails bleiben dünne Linien und konkurrieren nicht mit der Farbe."},"pull":"REST, RESET, GO AGAIN.","tip":{"ko":"쉬는 시간이 길어지면 몸이 식는 느낌에 맞춰 지퍼를 조절해요.","en":"If the rest gets long and you start to cool down, adjust the zip.","de":"Wird die Pause länger und kühlst du aus, den Reißverschluss anpassen."}},"items":["of15-05-run-f.01-outer","of15-05-run-f.02-top","of15-05-run-f.03-bottom","of15-05-run-f.04-hands","of15-05-run-f.05-shoes","of15-05-run-f.06-gear"]},
    {"id":"of15-06-street-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/day/06-street/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"옥스블러드 레더와 회색 후디. 작은 코발트 백으로 마침표.","en":"Oxblood leather and a grey hoodie. A small cobalt bag as the full stop.","de":"Ochsenblutrotes Leder und grauer Hoodie. Eine kleine kobaltblaue Tasche als Schlusspunkt."},"article":{"title":"AFTER THE RECORD SHOP","intro":{"ko":"광택 있는 가죽과 보송한 후디를 겹쳐요. 아래는 짙은 배럴 데님으로 넓게, 신발은 실버로 밝게. 작은 파란 가방이 색의 균형을 바꿔줘요.","en":"Layer shiny leather over a soft hoodie. Wide, dark barrel denim below, bright silver shoes. A small blue bag shifts the balance of colour.","de":"Glänzendes Leder über weichem Hoodie. Unten weite, dunkle Barrel-Jeans, silberne Schuhe. Eine kleine blaue Tasche verschiebt die Farbbalance."},"pull":"ONE BOLD DETAIL IS ENOUGH.","tip":{"ko":"후드는 재킷 밖으로 자연스럽게 꺼내 목 주변의 볼륨을 정리해요.","en":"Pull the hood out over the jacket naturally to tidy the volume around the neck.","de":"Die Kapuze locker über die Jacke legen, damit das Volumen am Hals ordentlich bleibt."}},"items":["of15-06-street-f.01-outer","of15-06-street-f.02-top","of15-06-street-f.03-bottom","of15-06-street-f.04-shoes","of15-06-street-f.05-bag","of15-06-street-f.06-jewelry"]},
    {"id":"of15-07-street-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/day/07-street/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"모스 재킷과 초콜릿 코듀로이. 발목의 옐로가 살짝.","en":"A moss jacket and chocolate corduroy. A hint of yellow at the ankle.","de":"Moosgrüne Jacke und schokobrauner Cord. Ein Hauch Gelb am Knöchel."},"article":{"title":"SOFT SPOT ON THE CORNER","intro":{"ko":"유틸리티 재킷과 골이 있는 팬츠를 섞어 표면을 풍성하게 만들어요. 스트라이프는 안쪽에, 노랑은 발목에만. 편하게 쪼그려 앉아도 옷의 볼륨이 살아 있어요.","en":"Mix a utility jacket with ribbed trousers for rich texture. Stripes inside, yellow only at the ankle. The volume holds even when you crouch.","de":"Eine Utility-Jacke zu Cordhose für viel Textur. Streifen innen, Gelb nur am Knöchel. Das Volumen bleibt, auch in der Hocke."},"pull":"EASY SHAPES, GOOD COMPANY.","tip":{"ko":"상하의가 넉넉할 땐 발끝을 단단한 로퍼로 정리해요.","en":"When top and bottom are roomy, finish the feet with sturdy loafers.","de":"Sind Ober- und Unterteil weit, die Füße mit kräftigen Loafern abschließen."}},"items":["of15-07-street-f.01-outer","of15-07-street-f.02-top","of15-07-street-f.03-bottom","of15-07-street-f.04-socks","of15-07-street-f.05-shoes","of15-07-street-f.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"of15-08-street-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/day/08-street/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"머스터드 체크와 플리츠. 점심시간에도 분명한 취향.","en":"Mustard check and pleats. A clear taste, even at lunch.","de":"Senf-Karo und Falten. Klarer Geschmack, auch in der Mittagspause."},"article":{"title":"CHECKS AND CHOPSTICKS","intro":{"ko":"큰 체크를 걸치고 안쪽은 검정으로 정리해요. 스커트의 주름과 부츠의 무게가 만나면 부드러운 옷도 단단한 인상을 남겨요.","en":"Throw on a big check and keep the inside black. Pleats meeting heavy boots give soft clothes a firm impression.","de":"Ein großes Karo überwerfen, innen Schwarz. Falten treffen auf schwere Boots, so wirkt weiche Kleidung bestimmt."},"pull":"PATTERN UP. KEEP IT EASY.","tip":{"ko":"체크와 플리츠가 함께 있으니 액세서리는 작은 실버로 모아요.","en":"With check and pleats together, keep accessories to small silver pieces.","de":"Bei Karo und Falten die Accessoires auf kleines Silber beschränken."}},"items":["of15-08-street-f.01-outer","of15-08-street-f.02-top","of15-08-street-f.03-bottom","of15-08-street-f.04-hosiery","of15-08-street-f.05-shoes","of15-08-street-f.06-jewelry","of15-08-street-f.07-jewelry"]},
    {"id":"of15-09-street-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/day/09-street/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"슬레이트 봄버 아래 숨겨둔 푸시아. 넓은 카고로 편하게.","en":"Fuchsia hidden under a slate bomber. Wide cargos for ease.","de":"Fuchsia versteckt unter einem schiefergrauen Bomber. Weite Cargohose für Bequemlichkeit."},"article":{"title":"FUCHSIA, FOUND","intro":{"ko":"회색과 검정의 넓은 면 사이에서 푸시아가 잠깐 보여요. 볼드한 색은 이너에만, 가방과 신발은 기능적인 형태로 정리해요.","en":"Fuchsia flashes between wide planes of grey and black. Keep the bold colour to the inner layer and the bag and shoes functional.","de":"Fuchsia blitzt zwischen großen Flächen aus Grau und Schwarz auf. Die kräftige Farbe nur innen, Tasche und Schuhe funktional."},"pull":"A FLASH OF COLOR.","tip":{"ko":"밝은 니트는 목과 소매에 조금만 보여도 충분한 포인트가 돼요.","en":"A bright knit only needs to show a little at neck and cuffs to be the accent.","de":"Ein heller Strick muss nur an Hals und Ärmeln etwas zu sehen sein, um zu wirken."}},"items":["of15-09-street-f.01-outer","of15-09-street-f.02-top","of15-09-street-f.03-bottom","of15-09-street-f.04-shoes","of15-09-street-f.05-bag"]},
    {"id":"of15-10-street-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/day/10-street/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"워싱 블랙과 올리브. 빨간 양말이 꽃다발만큼 작은 기분 전환.","en":"Washed black and olive. Red socks, a small mood lift like a bunch of flowers.","de":"Verwaschenes Schwarz und Oliv. Rote Socken, ein kleiner Stimmungsheber wie ein Blumenstrauß."},"article":{"title":"FLOWERS ON A GRAY DAY","intro":{"ko":"초어 재킷과 벌룬 팬츠를 느슨하게 이어줘요. 크림 니트로 얼굴 주변을 밝히고, 발목에 빨강을 한 줄 남겨요. 실버 체인은 니트 위에서 작게 빛나요.","en":"Link a chore jacket and balloon trousers loosely. A cream knit brightens the face, a line of red stays at the ankle, a silver chain glints on the knit.","de":"Chore-Jacke und Ballonhose locker verbinden. Ein cremefarbener Strick hellt das Gesicht auf, eine Linie Rot bleibt am Knöchel, eine Silberkette glänzt auf dem Strick."},"pull":"BRING YOUR OWN COLOR.","tip":{"ko":"꽃이나 가방처럼 색 있는 소품을 들 때는 옷의 색을 차분하게 맞춰요.","en":"When you carry something colourful like flowers or a bag, keep the clothes calm.","de":"Wenn du etwas Farbiges trägst, Blumen oder eine Tasche, die Kleidung ruhig halten."}},"items":["of15-10-street-f.01-outer","of15-10-street-f.02-top","of15-10-street-f.03-bottom","of15-10-street-f.04-socks","of15-10-street-f.05-shoes","of15-10-street-f.06-jewelry","of15-10-street-f.07-eyewear","of15-10-street-f.08-bag"]},
    {"id":"of15-11-minimal-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/day/11-minimal/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"차콜 랩 재킷과 옅은 블루. 손목의 실버 한 면.","en":"A charcoal wrap jacket and pale blue. A flash of silver at the wrist.","de":"Anthrazitfarbene Wickeljacke und Hellblau. Ein Silberblitz am Handgelenk."},"article":{"title":"A QUIET TURN","intro":{"ko":"비대칭 여밈이 있는 재킷을 중심으로, 이너는 부드러운 하늘색으로 골라요. 작은 움직임에서 드러나는 소매와 커프가 이 룩의 디테일이에요.","en":"Centre the look on an asymmetric wrap jacket and pick a soft sky blue underneath. Sleeves and cuff showing in small movements are the details here.","de":"Im Mittelpunkt eine asymmetrische Wickeljacke, darunter ein weiches Himmelblau. Ärmel und Armreif, die sich bei kleinen Bewegungen zeigen, sind die Details."},"pull":"SHAPE FIRST. DETAIL SECOND.","tip":{"ko":"랩 여밈을 너무 조이지 않고 옷의 드레이프를 남겨요.","en":"Don't tie the wrap too tight; keep the drape.","de":"Die Wickelung nicht zu fest ziehen, den Fall des Stoffs erhalten."}},"items":["of15-11-minimal-f.01-outer","of15-11-minimal-f.02-top","of15-11-minimal-f.03-bottom","of15-11-minimal-f.04-jewelry","of15-11-minimal-f.05-bag"]},
    {"id":"of15-12-minimal-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/day/12-minimal/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"에스프레소 코트 안의 버터 옐로. 돌계단에서 잠깐 방향을 고르기.","en":"Butter yellow inside an espresso coat. Choosing a direction on stone steps.","de":"Buttergelb unter einem espressobraunen Mantel. Auf Steinstufen kurz die Richtung wählen."},"article":{"title":"BUTTER UNDER ESPRESSO","intro":{"ko":"브라운과 옐로를 부드럽게 겹치고, 아래는 짙은 네이비로 정리해요. 발목의 양말과 버건디 로퍼가 조용한 배색을 완성해요.","en":"Layer brown and yellow softly and keep the bottom in deep navy. Socks at the ankle and burgundy loafers complete the quiet palette.","de":"Braun und Gelb weich übereinander, unten tiefes Navy. Socken am Knöchel und bordeauxrote Loafer vollenden die ruhige Palette."},"pull":"SOFT COLOR, SURE STEP.","tip":{"ko":"짧은 코트 아래로 팬츠의 곧은 선이 이어지게 해요.","en":"Let the trousers' straight line continue below the short coat.","de":"Unter dem kurzen Mantel die gerade Linie der Hose weiterlaufen lassen."}},"items":["of15-12-minimal-f.01-outer","of15-12-minimal-f.02-top","of15-12-minimal-f.03-bottom","of15-12-minimal-f.04-socks","of15-12-minimal-f.05-shoes","of15-12-minimal-f.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"of15-13-minimal-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/day/13-minimal/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"슬레이트 트렌치와 토프 팬츠. 작은 빨간 파우치로 시선 모으기.","en":"A slate trench and taupe trousers. A small red pouch draws the eye.","de":"Schiefergrauer Trench und taupe Hose. Eine kleine rote Tasche zieht den Blick."},"article":{"title":"RED, JUST A LITTLE","intro":{"ko":"회색 계열의 큰 면을 겹치고 붉은색은 아주 작게 써요. 걷는 순간 생기는 코트의 선과 넓은 팬츠가 주인공이고, 가방은 작은 마침표예요.","en":"Layer large planes of grey and use red only very small. The coat's line as you walk and the wide trousers lead; the bag is a small full stop.","de":"Große Flächen in Grau übereinander, Rot nur ganz klein. Die Linie des Mantels beim Gehen und die weite Hose führen, die Tasche ist ein kleiner Schlusspunkt."},"pull":"KEEP THE COLOR CLOSE.","tip":{"ko":"작은 크로스백은 몸 가까이 짧게 메면 코트의 선을 덜 가려요.","en":"Wear a small crossbody short and close to the body so it hides less of the coat's line.","de":"Eine kleine Crossbody-Tasche kurz und nah am Körper tragen, dann verdeckt sie weniger von der Mantellinie."}},"items":["of15-13-minimal-f.01-outer","of15-13-minimal-f.02-top","of15-13-minimal-f.03-bottom","of15-13-minimal-f.04-shoes","of15-13-minimal-f.05-bag"]},
    {"id":"of15-14-minimal-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/day/14-minimal/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"짧은 케이프와 긴 스커트. 자전거 옆에서 드러나는 서로 다른 길이.","en":"A short cape and a long skirt. Different lengths, next to a bike.","de":"Kurzes Cape und langer Rock. Unterschiedliche Längen neben dem Fahrrad."},"article":{"title":"CAPE, COLUMN, CITY","intro":{"ko":"상체는 짧고 넓게, 아래는 길고 곧게. 검은 케이프 아래로 아이보리 소매를 드러내면 형태가 분명해져요. 긴 부츠로 발끝까지 색을 이어줘요.","en":"Short and wide on top, long and straight below. Ivory sleeves under a black cape make the shape clear. Long boots carry the colour down to your feet.","de":"Oben kurz und weit, unten lang und gerade. Elfenbeinfarbene Ärmel unter schwarzem Cape machen die Form klar. Lange Stiefel führen die Farbe bis zum Fuß."},"pull":"PLAY WITH LENGTH.","tip":{"ko":"긴 스커트와 케이프를 입고 자전거를 탈 땐 옷자락과 바퀴 간섭을 확인해요.","en":"On a bike in a long skirt and cape, check that the fabric stays clear of the wheels.","de":"Mit langem Rock und Cape auf dem Rad prüfen, dass der Stoff nicht in die Räder gerät."}},"items":["of15-14-minimal-f.01-outer","of15-14-minimal-f.02-top","of15-14-minimal-f.03-bottom","of15-14-minimal-f.04-hosiery","of15-14-minimal-f.05-shoes","of15-14-minimal-f.06-jewelry","of15-14-minimal-f.07-bag"]},
    {"id":"of15-15-minimal-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/day/15-minimal/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"플럼 베스트 수트 안에 그레이 터틀넥. 빵을 나누는 느긋한 손.","en":"A grey turtleneck inside a plum waistcoat suit. Unhurried hands sharing bread.","de":"Grauer Rollkragen unter einem pflaumenfarbenen Westen-Anzug. Ruhige Hände teilen Brot."},"article":{"title":"PLUM BEFORE NOON","intro":{"ko":"같은 플럼으로 상하의를 맞추고, 소매와 목선은 회색으로 비워요. 재킷 없이도 베스트의 선이 전체를 정리해줘요. 흐린 낮에 어울리는 깊고 차분한 조합이에요.","en":"Match top and bottom in the same plum and leave sleeves and neckline grey. Even without a jacket, the waistcoat's lines pull it together. Deep, calm colours for a grey day.","de":"Ober- und Unterteil im selben Pflaume, Ärmel und Kragen in Grau. Auch ohne Sakko hält die Weste alles zusammen. Tiefe, ruhige Farben für einen grauen Tag."},"pull":"TAILORED, WITH ROOM TO BREATHE.","tip":{"ko":"베스트 안의 니트는 팔과 어깨가 편하게 움직일 만큼 얇게 맞춰요.","en":"Keep the knit under the waistcoat thin enough for arms and shoulders to move freely.","de":"Den Strick unter der Weste dünn halten, damit Arme und Schultern frei bleiben."}},"items":["of15-15-minimal-f.01-outer","of15-15-minimal-f.02-top","of15-15-minimal-f.03-bottom","of15-15-minimal-f.04-shoes","of15-15-minimal-f.05-watch","of15-15-minimal-f.06-jewelry","of15-15-minimal-f.07-bag"]},
    {"id":"ofn-01-run-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"run","gender":"f","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/night/01-running/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"푸른 셸이 어둠을 가르고, 반사선이 움직임을 따라가요.","en":"A blue shell cuts through the dark, reflective lines follow every move.","de":"Eine blaue Shell durchschneidet die Dunkelheit, Reflexstreifen folgen jeder Bewegung."},"article":{"title":"BLUE HOUR, BRIGHT STRIDE","intro":{"ko":"짧은 셸과 긴 팬츠로 움직임을 가볍게. 손과 귀는 얇게 덮고, 속도에 맞춰 지퍼를 조절해요. 흐린 저녁의 강변에서는 얇은 이너와 지퍼형 셸로 겹을 나눠요. 달리는 동안은 지퍼로 조절하고, 멈춰 쉬는 순간에는 다시 여며주세요.","en":"A short shell and full-length pants keep you moving light. Cover hands and ears thinly and work the zip to your pace. On the riverside on a grey evening, split the layers into a thin base and a zip shell. Adjust the zip while you run, and close it again when you stop to rest.","de":"Kurze Shell und lange Hose halten dich leicht in Bewegung. Hände und Ohren dünn bedecken, den Reißverschluss dem Tempo anpassen. Am Fluss an einem grauen Abend teilst du die Lagen in ein dünnes Baselayer und eine Zip-Shell. Beim Laufen mit dem Reißverschluss regulieren, bei der Pause wieder schließen."},"pull":"MOVE INTO THE EVENING."},"items":["ofn-01-run-f.01-outer","ofn-01-run-f.02-top","ofn-01-run-f.03-bottom","ofn-01-run-f.04-gloves","ofn-01-run-f.05-socks","ofn-01-run-f.06-shoes","ofn-01-run-f.07-headwear"]},
    {"id":"ofn-02-run-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"run","gender":"f","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/night/02-running/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"스톤 컬러와 잉크 블루. 출발 전 잠깐의 정적.","en":"Stone and ink blue. A moment of stillness before the start.","de":"Stein und Tintenblau. Ein stiller Moment vor dem Start."},"article":{"title":"PAUSE, TIE, GO","intro":{"ko":"밝은 셸 아래 어두운 타이츠를 이어 실루엣을 선명하게 만들어요. 끈을 묶고 장갑을 정리하는 순간까지 착장의 일부예요. 끈을 묶으려고 몸을 낮춰도 허리와 발목이 드러나지 않게 길이를 맞춰요. 밝은 재킷에 짙은 하의를 붙이면 실루엣이 더 또렷해져요.","en":"Dark tights under a light shell make the silhouette crisp. Even tying your laces and pulling on gloves is part of the look. Match the lengths so waist and ankles stay covered when you crouch to tie your shoes. A light jacket over dark legs makes the outline even sharper.","de":"Dunkle Tights unter einer hellen Shell machen die Silhouette klar. Auch Schuhe binden und Handschuhe richten gehört zum Look. Längen so wählen, dass Taille und Knöchel beim Bücken bedeckt bleiben. Helle Jacke über dunklen Beinen macht die Kontur noch schärfer."},"pull":"A MOMENT BEFORE MOTION."},"items":["ofn-02-run-f.01-outer","ofn-02-run-f.02-top","ofn-02-run-f.03-bottom","ofn-02-run-f.04-gloves","ofn-02-run-f.05-socks","ofn-02-run-f.06-shoes","ofn-02-run-f.07-headwear"]},
    {"id":"ofn-03-run-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"run","gender":"f","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/night/03-running/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"올리브와 자두색, 은빛 반사선 한 줄.","en":"Olive and plum, one line of silver reflection.","de":"Oliv und Pflaume, eine silberne Reflexlinie."},"article":{"title":"OLIVE AFTER HOURS","intro":{"ko":"차분한 색끼리 겹치고 빛은 반사 디테일에 맡겨요. 장갑을 당겨 끼우는 작은 동작이 사진에 리듬을 남겨요. 차가운 공기 속에서는 손과 귀를 얇게 감싸고 출발해요. 큰 색은 올리브 하나로 두고, 플럼은 목과 머리 주변에 작게 반복합니다.","en":"Layer quiet colours and leave the light to the reflective details. The small gesture of pulling on a glove gives the picture its rhythm. In cold air, wrap hands and ears thinly before you set off. Keep olive as the one big colour and repeat plum in small doses around the neck and head.","de":"Ruhige Farben übereinander, das Licht übernehmen die Reflexdetails. Die kleine Geste beim Handschuhanziehen gibt dem Bild Rhythmus. In kalter Luft Hände und Ohren dünn einpacken, bevor du startest. Oliv bleibt die eine große Farbe, Pflaume kommt klein an Hals und Kopf wieder."},"pull":"KEEP THE PACE YOURS."},"items":["ofn-03-run-f.01-outer","ofn-03-run-f.02-top","ofn-03-run-f.03-bottom","ofn-03-run-f.04-gloves","ofn-03-run-f.05-socks","ofn-03-run-f.06-shoes","ofn-03-run-f.07-headwear"]},
    {"id":"ofn-04-run-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"run","gender":"f","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/night/04-running/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"검은 셸 아래 오렌지 한 면.","en":"One panel of orange under a black shell.","de":"Eine Fläche Orange unter schwarzer Shell."},"article":{"title":"ORANGE ON THE MOVE","intro":{"ko":"겉은 차분하게, 안은 선명하게. 스트레칭할 때 드러나는 오렌지와 은빛 디테일로 움직임을 보여줘요. 달리기 전 스트레칭부터 몸이 풀리는 구간까지, 겉옷을 여닫으며 조절하는 구성이에요. 주황은 목선과 지퍼 사이에 남겨 검정의 무게를 덜어줘요.","en":"Calm outside, vivid inside. The orange and silver details that show when you stretch tell the story of movement. From the warm-up stretch to the part where your body loosens, this outfit works by opening and closing the outer layer. Leave the orange between neckline and zip to lighten the black.","de":"Außen ruhig, innen kräftig. Orange und silberne Details, die beim Dehnen sichtbar werden, zeigen die Bewegung. Vom Dehnen vor dem Lauf bis der Körper warm ist, regulierst du über die Außenschicht. Das Orange bleibt zwischen Ausschnitt und Reißverschluss und nimmt dem Schwarz das Gewicht."},"pull":"WARM UP YOUR WAY."},"items":["ofn-04-run-f.01-outer","ofn-04-run-f.02-top","ofn-04-run-f.03-bottom","ofn-04-run-f.04-gloves","ofn-04-run-f.05-socks","ofn-04-run-f.06-shoes","ofn-04-run-f.07-headwear"]},
    {"id":"ofn-05-run-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"run","gender":"f","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/night/05-running/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"초콜릿과 네이비. 달리기 사이의 짧은 휴식.","en":"Chocolate and navy. A short break between runs.","de":"Schokolade und Navy. Eine kurze Pause zwischen den Läufen."},"article":{"title":"COCOA, THEN A BREATHER","intro":{"ko":"부드러운 갈색 셸에 아이보리 목선을 더해요. 잠깐 멈출 때는 지퍼를 여며 식는 느낌을 줄이고, 다시 출발하며 조절해요. 잠깐 쉬는 시간에는 열린 지퍼를 다시 올려요. 브라운과 네이비 사이로 아이보리를 드러내면 차분한 조합에도 표정이 생깁니다.","en":"Add an ivory neckline to a soft brown shell. When you pause, zip up so you don't cool down, then adjust again as you set off. During a short rest, pull the open zip back up. Letting ivory show between brown and navy gives a quiet combination some expression.","de":"Eine weiche braune Shell mit elfenbeinfarbenem Kragen. Beim Anhalten den Reißverschluss schließen, damit du nicht auskühlst, beim Weiterlaufen wieder anpassen. In der kurzen Pause den offenen Zipper wieder hochziehen. Elfenbein zwischen Braun und Navy gibt der ruhigen Kombination Ausdruck."},"pull":"TAKE A BREATHER."},"items":["ofn-05-run-f.01-outer","ofn-05-run-f.02-top","ofn-05-run-f.03-bottom","ofn-05-run-f.04-gloves","ofn-05-run-f.05-socks","ofn-05-run-f.06-shoes","ofn-05-run-f.07-headwear"]},
    {"id":"ofn-06-street-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/night/06-street/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"브라운 시어링, 짙은 데님, 따뜻한 빵 한 봉투.","en":"Brown shearling, dark denim, a warm bag of bread.","de":"Braunes Shearling, dunkler Denim, eine warme Tüte Brot."},"article":{"title":"BREAD AFTER DARK","intro":{"ko":"보송한 안감과 단단한 데님을 겹쳐요. 짧은 재킷 아래 바지를 넓게 내려 편안한 비율을 만들어요. 빵을 사러 나오는 짧은 외출에도 체감 5°C의 저녁 공기는 차가워요. 두툼한 칼라와 머플러를 겹치고, 발목은 데님과 부츠로 이어줍니다.","en":"Layer a fluffy lining over sturdy denim. Let wide trousers fall under a short jacket for an easy proportion. Even a quick trip out for bread means evening air that feels like 5°C. Layer a thick collar and a scarf, and carry the ankles through with denim and boots.","de":"Flauschiges Futter über festem Denim. Unter der kurzen Jacke fällt eine weite Hose für entspannte Proportionen. Auch für den kurzen Gang zum Bäcker ist die Abendluft mit gefühlten 5°C kalt. Dicken Kragen und Schal übereinander, an den Knöcheln gehen Denim und Stiefel ineinander über."},"pull":"TEXTURE DOES THE TALKING."},"items":["ofn-06-street-f.01-outer","ofn-06-street-f.02-top","ofn-06-street-f.03-bottom","ofn-06-street-f.04-shoes","ofn-06-street-f.05-scarf","ofn-06-street-f.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"ofn-07-street-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/night/07-street/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"붉은 재킷 하나로 저녁의 색을 바꿔요.","en":"One red jacket changes the colour of the evening.","de":"Eine rote Jacke verändert die Farbe des Abends."},"article":{"title":"RED AT THE WINDOW","intro":{"ko":"회색 니트와 검은 바지를 바탕으로 두고 레드에 집중해요. 넓은 바지와 짧은 재킷의 비율이 포인트예요. 따뜻한 가게 불빛 앞에서 레드가 가장 선명하게 보여요. 기다리는 동안에는 재킷을 여미고, 머플러 끝은 안쪽에 넣어 정리해요.","en":"Grey knit and black trousers are the base, so the focus stays on the red. The proportion of wide trousers and a short jacket is the point. Red shows at its brightest in front of warm shop lights. While you wait, close the jacket and tuck the scarf ends inside.","de":"Grauer Strick und schwarze Hose sind die Basis, der Fokus liegt auf Rot. Entscheidend ist das Verhältnis von weiter Hose und kurzer Jacke. Vor warmem Schaufensterlicht leuchtet Rot am stärksten. Beim Warten die Jacke schließen und die Schalenden nach innen stecken."},"pull":"LET RED LEAD."},"items":["ofn-07-street-f.01-outer","ofn-07-street-f.02-top","ofn-07-street-f.03-bottom","ofn-07-street-f.04-shoes","ofn-07-street-f.05-scarf","ofn-07-street-f.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"ofn-08-street-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/night/08-street/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"카키 퀼팅과 검은 데님. 레코드 숍을 나서는 순간.","en":"Khaki quilting and black denim. The moment you step out of the record shop.","de":"Khaki-Steppung und schwarzer Denim. Der Moment beim Verlassen des Plattenladens."},"article":{"title":"RECORDS AND QUILTING","intro":{"ko":"긴 아우터에 어두운 니트를 겹쳐요. 퀼팅의 표면과 데님의 결이 비슷한 색 안에서 차이를 만들어요. 레코드숍에서 나와 천천히 걷는 저녁에는 긴 퀼팅 코트를 중심으로 입어요. 체크 머플러와 옥스블러드 부츠가 차분한 색 사이를 연결합니다.","en":"Layer a dark knit under a long coat. The quilted surface and the denim grain create contrast within similar colours. For a slow evening walk home from the record shop, build the look around a long quilted coat. A check scarf and oxblood boots connect the quiet colours.","de":"Unter einen langen Mantel kommt ein dunkler Strick. Steppoberfläche und Denimstruktur schaffen Kontrast in ähnlichen Farben. Für den langsamen Abendweg vom Plattenladen nach Hause ist der lange Steppmantel das Zentrum. Karoschal und ochsenblutrote Stiefel verbinden die ruhigen Farben."},"pull":"TAKE THE LONG WAY HOME."},"items":["ofn-08-street-f.01-outer","ofn-08-street-f.02-top","ofn-08-street-f.03-bottom","ofn-08-street-f.04-shoes","ofn-08-street-f.05-scarf","ofn-08-street-f.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"ofn-09-street-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/night/09-street/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"차콜과 초콜릿 사이, 연보라 한 겹.","en":"A layer of lilac between charcoal and chocolate.","de":"Eine Lage Flieder zwischen Anthrazit und Schokobraun."},"article":{"title":"LILAC AT THE DOOR","intro":{"ko":"보온 봄버 안에 부드러운 라일락을 넣어요. 코듀로이의 세로 결이 넓은 바지의 형태를 잡아줘요. 현관 앞에서 열쇠를 찾는 짧은 순간을 담았어요. 봄버와 넉넉한 팬츠에 서로 다른 원단 결을 넣어, 편한 옷에도 깊이가 생기게 했습니다.","en":"Tuck soft lilac inside an insulated bomber. The vertical wale of corduroy holds the shape of wide trousers. This is the short moment of finding your keys at the front door. Different fabric textures in the bomber and roomy trousers give easy clothes some depth.","de":"Weiches Flieder unter einem wattierten Bomber. Die senkrechten Rippen des Cords halten die Form der weiten Hose. Der kurze Moment, in dem du an der Haustür den Schlüssel suchst. Verschiedene Stoffstrukturen in Bomber und weiter Hose geben bequemer Kleidung Tiefe."},"pull":"A SOFTER KIND OF COOL."},"items":["ofn-09-street-f.01-outer","ofn-09-street-f.02-top","ofn-09-street-f.03-bottom","ofn-09-street-f.04-shoes","ofn-09-street-f.05-scarf","ofn-09-street-f.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"ofn-10-street-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/night/10-street/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"네이비 피코트 안에 그린을 숨겨요.","en":"Green hidden inside a navy peacoat.","de":"Grün, versteckt in einem Navy-Caban."},"article":{"title":"GREEN UNDER NAVY","intro":{"ko":"어두운 코트 사이로 선명한 니트를 보여줘요. 회색 팬츠와 작은 검은 가방으로 균형을 맞춰요. 트램을 기다릴 때는 코트 앞을 여미고 목 주변을 머플러로 감싸요. 움직일 때 잠깐 드러나는 그린 니트가 이 착장의 포인트예요.","en":"Let a vivid knit show between the dark coat. Grey trousers and a small black bag keep the balance. Waiting for the tram, close the coat and wrap the scarf around your neck. The green knit that flashes when you move is the point of this look.","de":"Zwischen dem dunklen Mantel zeigt sich ein kräftiger Strick. Graue Hose und kleine schwarze Tasche halten die Balance. Beim Warten auf die Tram den Mantel schließen und den Schal um den Hals legen. Der grüne Strick, der in Bewegung aufblitzt, ist der Kern dieses Looks."},"pull":"ONE COLOR, ALL THE ENERGY."},"items":["ofn-10-street-f.01-outer","ofn-10-street-f.02-top","ofn-10-street-f.03-bottom","ofn-10-street-f.04-shoes","ofn-10-street-f.05-scarf","ofn-10-street-f.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"ofn-11-minimal-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/night/11-minimal/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"오트밀 코트 아래 에스프레소 한 줄.","en":"One line of espresso under an oatmeal coat.","de":"Eine Linie Espresso unter einem haferfarbenen Mantel."},"article":{"title":"OAT AFTER HOURS","intro":{"ko":"밝은 코트와 짙은 이너의 대비를 길게 이어가요. 장식은 줄이고 칼라와 바지의 선에 집중해요. 저녁 약속 장소로 들어서는 순간, 밝은 코트 뒤로 어두운 팬츠와 가방이 이어져요. 색을 늘리기보다 긴 코트와 매끈한 가죽의 질감 차이를 살립니다.","en":"Carry the contrast of a light coat and a dark inner layer in a long line. Cut the decoration and focus on the lines of collar and trousers. Walking into an evening date, dark trousers and bag follow behind the light coat. Rather than adding colours, play with the texture contrast of a long coat and smooth leather.","de":"Der Kontrast aus hellem Mantel und dunkler Innenlage zieht sich in einer langen Linie. Wenig Deko, Fokus auf Kragen und Hosenlinie. Beim Ankommen zur Verabredung am Abend folgen dunkle Hose und Tasche dem hellen Mantel. Statt mehr Farben zählt der Kontrast zwischen langem Mantel und glattem Leder."},"pull":"KEEP THE LINE LONG."},"items":["ofn-11-minimal-f.01-outer","ofn-11-minimal-f.02-top","ofn-11-minimal-f.03-bottom","ofn-11-minimal-f.04-shoes","ofn-11-minimal-f.05-scarf","ofn-11-minimal-f.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"ofn-12-minimal-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/night/12-minimal/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"검은 실루엣 위로 코발트 한 줄.","en":"A line of cobalt over a black silhouette.","de":"Eine Linie Kobalt über schwarzer Silhouette."},"article":{"title":"A BLUE INTERRUPTION","intro":{"ko":"검정과 아이보리를 단순하게 겹치고 머플러에만 선명한 파랑을 둬요. 코트의 여밈을 정리하면 색이 더 또렷해져요. 체감 5°C의 저녁에는 긴 코트와 목을 덮는 니트를 겹쳐요. 걸을 때 움직이는 파란 머플러가 단정한 검정 실루엣에 리듬을 더합니다.","en":"Layer black and ivory simply and keep vivid blue for the scarf only. Tidy the coat's closure and the colour reads even clearer. On an evening that feels like 5°C, layer a long coat with a knit that covers the neck. The blue scarf moving as you walk adds rhythm to the neat black silhouette.","de":"Schwarz und Elfenbein schlicht übereinander, kräftiges Blau nur am Schal. Ist der Mantel ordentlich geschlossen, wirkt die Farbe noch klarer. An einem Abend mit gefühlten 5°C langer Mantel und ein Strick, der den Hals bedeckt. Der blaue Schal, der sich beim Gehen bewegt, bringt Rhythmus in die klare schwarze Silhouette."},"pull":"ONE BLUE NOTE."},"items":["ofn-12-minimal-f.01-outer","ofn-12-minimal-f.02-top","ofn-12-minimal-f.03-bottom","ofn-12-minimal-f.04-shoes","ofn-12-minimal-f.05-scarf","ofn-12-minimal-f.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"ofn-13-minimal-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/night/13-minimal/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"회색 코트 사이로 버건디가 보여요.","en":"Burgundy shows between grey coats.","de":"Burgunder zeigt sich zwischen Grau."},"article":{"title":"BURGUNDY BETWEEN GRAYS","intro":{"ko":"더블 코트와 플리츠 팬츠를 회색으로 맞춰요. 목을 덮는 붉은 니트가 차가운 배경에 작은 온기를 더해요. 회색 코트와 팬츠를 가까운 톤으로 연결하고, 버건디는 목선과 가방에 반복해요. 긴 기장 안에서도 걸음이 편하도록 팬츠 밑단은 바닥에서 살짝 띄웁니다.","en":"Match a double-breasted coat and pleated trousers in grey. A red knit covering the neck adds a little warmth to the cold backdrop. Link the grey coat and trousers in close tones and repeat burgundy at the neckline and on the bag. Let the hems sit just off the ground so walking stays easy in the long length.","de":"Zweireiher und Bundfaltenhose in Grau. Ein roter Strick am Hals bringt etwas Wärme vor den kühlen Hintergrund. Grauer Mantel und Hose in nahen Tönen, Burgunder wiederholt sich am Kragen und an der Tasche. Der Saum schwebt knapp über dem Boden, so geht es sich auch in langer Länge bequem."},"pull":"QUIET, WITH COLOR."},"items":["ofn-13-minimal-f.01-outer","ofn-13-minimal-f.02-top","ofn-13-minimal-f.03-bottom","ofn-13-minimal-f.04-shoes","ofn-13-minimal-f.05-scarf","ofn-13-minimal-f.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"ofn-14-minimal-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/night/14-minimal/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"초콜릿 코트, 크림 소매, 긴 네이비 스커트.","en":"Chocolate coat, cream sleeves, a long navy skirt.","de":"Schokobrauner Mantel, cremefarbene Ärmel, langer Navy-Rock."},"article":{"title":"ESPRESSO AT THE CAFE","intro":{"ko":"서로 다른 어두운 색을 겹쳐 깊이를 만들어요. 크림 니트가 얼굴과 손목 주변에 밝은 면을 남겨줘요. 카페 앞에 잠시 머무르는 장면이에요. 롱 스커트 아래 타이츠와 긴 부츠를 겹쳐 다리가 드러나는 틈을 줄이고, 코트는 여유 있게 걸쳐요.","en":"Layer different dark colours to build depth. The cream knit leaves light areas around the face and wrists. A moment lingering outside a café. Tights and tall boots under the long skirt close the gap where legs would show, and the coat goes on loosely.","de":"Verschiedene dunkle Farben übereinander schaffen Tiefe. Der cremefarbene Strick lässt helle Flächen an Gesicht und Handgelenken. Ein kurzer Halt vor dem Café. Strumpfhose und hohe Stiefel unter dem langen Rock schließen die Lücke am Bein, der Mantel sitzt locker."},"pull":"SOFT EDGES, LONG LINES."},"items":["ofn-14-minimal-f.01-outer","ofn-14-minimal-f.02-top","ofn-14-minimal-f.03-bottom","ofn-14-minimal-f.04-hosiery","ofn-14-minimal-f.05-shoes","ofn-14-minimal-f.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"ofn-15-minimal-f","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Female/35+/night/15-minimal/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"잉크 블루와 레드, 긴 코트 안의 짧은 대비.","en":"Ink blue and red, a short contrast inside a long coat.","de":"Tintenblau und Rot, ein kurzer Kontrast im langen Mantel."},"article":{"title":"RED BEFORE HOME","intro":{"ko":"선명한 빨강을 니트에 넣고 겉은 짙은 파랑으로 덮어요. 차콜 팬츠와 검은 부츠로 아래쪽을 차분하게 정리해요. 집으로 돌아가는 저녁, 빨간 니트를 얼굴 가까이에 남겨요. 코트와 머플러는 같은 네이비 계열로 묶어 색이 흩어지지 않게 정리합니다.","en":"Put vivid red in the knit and cover it with deep blue. Charcoal trousers and black boots keep the lower half calm. On the way home in the evening, keep the red knit close to your face. Tie coat and scarf together in the same navy family so the colours don't scatter.","de":"Kräftiges Rot im Strick, darüber tiefes Blau. Anthrazit Hose und schwarze Stiefel halten die untere Hälfte ruhig. Auf dem Heimweg am Abend bleibt der rote Strick nah am Gesicht. Mantel und Schal in derselben Navy-Familie, damit die Farben nicht zerfallen."},"pull":"A LITTLE RED GOES FAR."},"items":["ofn-15-minimal-f.01-outer","ofn-15-minimal-f.02-top","ofn-15-minimal-f.03-bottom","ofn-15-minimal-f.04-shoes","ofn-15-minimal-f.05-scarf","ofn-15-minimal-f.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-01","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"run","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/running/01/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"가벼운 비 사이, 오렌지 셸과 실버 러닝화로 경쾌하게.","en":"Between light showers, an orange shell and silver runners keep it lively.","de":"Zwischen leichten Schauern: orange Shell und silberne Laufschuhe, leicht und flott."},"article":{"title":"SKIP THE PUDDLE","intro":{"ko":"오렌지 러닝 셸 안에 차콜 이너를 겹치고, 블랙 타이츠와 차콜 양말로 이어지는 착장이에요. 실버 그레이 러닝화와 작은 반사 디테일이 직광 플래시에 선명하게 드러나요.","en":"A charcoal base layer under an orange running shell, carried down by black tights and charcoal socks. Silver-grey runners and small reflective details catch the flash.","de":"Ein anthrazit Baselayer unter einer orangen Laufshell, darunter schwarze Tights und anthrazit Socken. Silbergraue Laufschuhe und kleine Reflexdetails leuchten im Blitzlicht."},"pull":"A LITTLE RAIN, A LIVELY STEP."},"items":["bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-01.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-01.02-top","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-01.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-01.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-01.05-shoes"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-02","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"run","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/running/02/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"균형을 잡는 순간, 밝은 셸과 네이비 레이어.","en":"Finding your balance: a light shell over navy layers.","de":"Kurz Balance finden: helle Shell über Navy-Lagen."},"article":{"title":"FIND YOUR BALANCE","intro":{"ko":"밝은 오프화이트 셸이 비 오는 회색 거리에서 몸을 또렷하게 보여줘요. 안쪽과 아래는 네이비로 맞춰 색을 단순하게 두고, 젖은 바닥에선 밑단이 좁은 팬츠가 편해요.","en":"A bright off-white shell makes you easy to see on a grey, wet street. Keep the base and bottoms navy so the colours stay simple, and on wet ground tapered pants stay out of the way.","de":"Eine helle offwhite Shell macht dich auf der grauen, nassen Straße gut sichtbar. Innen und unten bleibt alles Navy, so bleiben die Farben ruhig; auf nassem Boden sind schmal zulaufende Hosen angenehm."},"pull":"FIND YOUR BALANCE."},"items":["bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-02.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-02.02-top","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-02.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-02.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-02.05-shoes"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-03","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"run","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/running/03/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"끈을 고쳐 묶고, 네이비 셸로 다시 출발.","en":"Retie the laces, set off again in a navy shell.","de":"Schnürsenkel neu binden, in der Navy-Shell wieder los."},"article":{"title":"ONE MORE LOOP","intro":{"ko":"후드를 쓴 네이비 셸이 가벼운 비를 막고, 소매 끝으로 밝은 회색 이너가 살짝 보여요. 블랙 타이츠와 오프화이트 러닝화로 아래는 깔끔하게 정리해요.","en":"A hooded navy shell keeps light rain off, with a light grey base peeking out at the cuffs. Black tights and off-white runners keep the lower half clean.","de":"Eine Navy-Shell mit Kapuze hält leichten Regen ab, an den Bündchen blitzt ein hellgraues Baselayer hervor. Schwarze Tights und offwhite Laufschuhe halten unten alles klar."},"pull":"ONE MORE LOOP."},"items":["bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-03.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-03.02-top","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-03.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-03.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-03.05-shoes"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-04","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"run","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/running/04/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"손바닥으로 비를 확인하는 코발트 블루 러닝 룩.","en":"Checking the rain with an open palm, in cobalt blue.","de":"Mit offener Hand den Regen prüfen, in Kobaltblau."},"article":{"title":"IS THAT ALL?","intro":{"ko":"코발트 블루 셸 하나로 회색 날에 색을 더해요. 안은 차콜 하프집, 아래는 차콜 팬츠로 낮게 맞추고, 신발은 밝은 회색으로 가볍게 끝내요.","en":"One cobalt blue shell brings colour to a grey day. A charcoal half-zip inside and charcoal pants below keep the rest low, and pale grey shoes finish it lightly.","de":"Eine kobaltblaue Shell bringt Farbe in einen grauen Tag. Innen ein anthrazit Half-Zip, unten eine anthrazit Hose, und hellgraue Schuhe schließen leicht ab."},"pull":"IS THAT ALL?"},"items":["bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-04.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-04.02-top","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-04.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-04.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-04.05-shoes"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-05","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"run","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/running/05/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"낙엽 하나를 털고, 그레이와 그린으로 가볍게.","en":"Brush off a leaf, keep it light in grey and green.","de":"Ein Blatt abstreifen, leicht bleiben in Grau und Grün."},"article":{"title":"LEAVE IT BEHIND","intro":{"ko":"스톤 그레이 셸에 포레스트 그린 타이츠를 맞춰 가을 길과 어울리게 했어요. 안쪽은 블랙 이너로 정리하고, 크림 그레이 러닝화가 젖은 바닥 위에서 밝게 보여요.","en":"A stone grey shell with forest green tights, made for an autumn path. A black base keeps the inside simple, and cream-grey runners stay bright on the wet ground.","de":"Eine steingraue Shell mit waldgrünen Tights, passend zum Herbstweg. Innen ein schwarzes Baselayer, und cremegraue Laufschuhe leuchten auf dem nassen Boden."},"pull":"LEAVE IT BEHIND."},"items":["bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-05.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-05.02-top","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-05.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-05.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-05.05-shoes"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-01","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"street","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/street/01/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"안장을 닦고 출발. 세이지 우비와 다크 데님의 비 오는 낮.","en":"Wipe the saddle, then go. A sage raincoat and dark denim for a rainy day.","de":"Sattel abwischen, los geht's. Salbeigrüner Regenmantel und dunkler Denim für einen Regentag."},"article":{"title":"READY FOR A LITTLE RAIN","intro":{"ko":"세이지 후드 우비 안에 차콜 니트를 입고, 밑단을 한 번 접은 다크 데님에 첼시 레인부츠를 신었어요. 크로스백은 블랙으로 맞춰 몸 앞에.","en":"A charcoal knit under a sage hooded raincoat, dark denim cuffed once over Chelsea rain boots. The crossbody in black, worn in front.","de":"Ein anthrazit Strick unter dem salbeigrünen Kapuzenregenmantel, dunkler Denim einmal umgeschlagen über Chelsea-Gummistiefeln. Die Crossbody-Tasche in Schwarz, vorne getragen."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-01.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-01.02-top","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-01.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-01.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-01.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-01.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-02","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"street","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/street/02/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"코발트 우비와 크림 니트, 가벼운 비 속 장보기.","en":"A cobalt raincoat and a cream knit, groceries in light rain.","de":"Kobaltblauer Regenmantel und cremefarbener Strick: Einkaufen im leichten Regen."},"article":{"title":"GROCERIES IN THE DRIZZLE","intro":{"ko":"코발트 우비를 열어 크림 케이블 니트를 보이고, 차콜 팬츠와 블랙 더비로 아래를 차분하게 눌렀어요. 작은 크로스백은 몸에, 장바구니는 한 손에, 접은 우산은 다른 손에.","en":"The cobalt raincoat worn open over a cream cable knit, with charcoal trousers and black derbies keeping the lower half calm. A small crossbody on the body, the tote in one hand, the folded umbrella in the other.","de":"Der kobaltblaue Regenmantel offen über einem cremefarbenen Zopfstrick, anthrazit Hose und schwarze Derbys halten unten alles ruhig. Kleine Crossbody-Tasche am Körper, Einkaufsbeutel in der einen, Knirps in der anderen Hand."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-02.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-02.02-top","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-02.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-02.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-02.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-02.06-bag","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-02.07-tote","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-02.08-umbrella"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-03","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"street","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/street/03/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"버건디 우비와 샌드 팬츠, 우산을 붙잡는 비 오는 낮.","en":"A burgundy raincoat and sand trousers, holding on to the umbrella on a rainy day.","de":"Bordeauxroter Regenmantel und sandfarbene Hose: am Regentag den Schirm festhalten."},"article":{"title":"HOLD ON TO THE MOMENT","intro":{"ko":"버건디 우비에 그레이 니트, 밑단을 접은 샌드 치노와 블랙 레이스업 부츠. 롤탑 백팩을 메면 두 손이 자유로워 바람에 휘는 장우산도 꽉 잡을 수 있어요.","en":"Grey knit under a burgundy raincoat, sand chinos cuffed over black lace-up boots. A roll-top backpack keeps both hands free to hold the long umbrella when the wind tugs at it.","de":"Grauer Strick unter einem bordeauxroten Regenmantel, sandfarbene Chinos umgeschlagen über schwarzen Schnürstiefeln. Der Rolltop-Rucksack lässt beide Hände frei, um den langen Schirm im Wind festzuhalten."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-03.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-03.02-top","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-03.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-03.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-03.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-03.06-backpack","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-03.07-umbrella"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-04","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"street","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/street/04/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"차콜 우비와 오렌지 비니, 커피 트럭 앞 잠깐의 여유.","en":"A charcoal raincoat and an orange beanie, a short break at the coffee truck.","de":"Anthrazit Regenmantel und orange Beanie: kurze Pause am Kaffeewagen."},"article":{"title":"COFFEE ON THE GO","intro":{"ko":"차콜 우비 안에 크림 후디를 입고 후디 모자를 밖으로 꺼냈어요. 연한 블루 데님과 블랙 스니커즈로 편하게, 오렌지 비니 하나로 색을 더했어요.","en":"A cream hoodie under the charcoal raincoat, its hood pulled out over the collar. Light blue denim and black sneakers keep it easy; one orange beanie adds the colour.","de":"Ein cremefarbener Hoodie unter dem anthrazit Regenmantel, die Kapuze über den Kragen gezogen. Hellblaue Jeans und schwarze Sneaker halten es lässig, eine orange Beanie bringt die Farbe."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-04.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-04.02-top","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-04.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-04.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-04.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-04.06-beanie","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-04.07-bag"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-05","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"street","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/street/05/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"매트한 토프 우비와 브라운 니트, 인디고 데님의 조합.","en":"A matte taupe raincoat, a brown knit and indigo denim.","de":"Matter taupefarbener Regenmantel, brauner Strick und Indigo-Denim."},"article":{"title":"FOUND THE KEYS","intro":{"ko":"무릎까지 오는 토프 우비에 초콜릿 브라운 니트, 인디고 데님과 블랙 레이스업 앵클부츠. 흙빛 톤으로 맞춰 차분하고, 크로스백은 열쇠를 바로 꺼낼 수 있게 앞으로.","en":"A knee-length taupe raincoat over a chocolate brown knit, indigo denim and black lace-up ankle boots. Earthy tones keep it calm; the crossbody sits in front so the keys are right at hand.","de":"Ein knielanger taupefarbener Regenmantel über schokobraunem Strick, Indigo-Denim und schwarzen Schnür-Stiefeletten. Erdige Töne halten es ruhig, die Crossbody-Tasche sitzt vorn, die Schlüssel sind gleich zur Hand."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-05.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-05.02-top","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-05.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-05.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-05.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-street-05.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-01","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/minimal/01/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"차콜 레인코트와 포근한 아이보리 니트. 작은 물웅덩이도 가볍게.","en":"A charcoal raincoat and a soft ivory knit. Small puddles, taken lightly.","de":"Anthrazit Regenmantel und weicher elfenbeinfarbener Strick. Kleine Pfützen nimmt man leicht."},"article":{"title":"A SMALL RAIN DANCE","intro":{"ko":"차콜 후드 레인코트를 열어 아이보리 모헤어 니트를 보이고, 블랙 와이드 팬츠와 첼시부츠로 아래를 어둡게 이었어요. 숄더 토트는 코트와 같은 차콜로.","en":"A charcoal hooded raincoat worn open over an ivory mohair knit, with black wide trousers and Chelsea boots keeping the lower half dark. The shoulder tote matches the coat in charcoal.","de":"Ein anthrazit Kapuzenregenmantel offen über elfenbeinfarbenem Mohair, schwarze weite Hose und Chelsea-Boots halten unten alles dunkel. Die Schultertasche im selben Anthrazit wie der Mantel."},"tip":{"ko":"비를 막는 아우터 안에 포근한 니트를 겹치고 차분한 하의로 균형을 잡아 보세요.","en":"Layer a cosy knit under a coat that keeps the rain out, and balance it with a calm bottom half.","de":"Unter einen regendichten Mantel einen kuscheligen Strick, unten etwas Ruhiges als Ausgleich."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-01.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-01.02-top","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-01.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-01.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-01.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-01.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-02","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/minimal/02/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"베이지 맥코트에 브라운 모헤어. 우산 아래 가까워지는 순간.","en":"A beige mac over brown mohair. The moment you step under the umbrella together.","de":"Beiger Regenmantel über braunem Mohair. Der Moment, in dem man unter dem Schirm zusammenrückt."},"article":{"title":"COME UNDER THE UMBRELLA","intro":{"ko":"베이지 레인 맥코트 안에 브라운 모헤어 터틀넥, 아래는 크림 팬츠와 브라운 앵클부츠. 같은 흙빛 톤으로 맞추고 작은 브라운 크로스백으로 마무리했어요.","en":"A brown mohair turtleneck under a beige rain mac, cream trousers and brown ankle boots below. One earthy palette, finished with a small brown crossbody.","de":"Ein brauner Mohair-Rollkragen unter einem beigen Regenmantel, darunter cremefarbene Hose und braune Stiefeletten. Eine erdige Palette, abgerundet mit einer kleinen braunen Crossbody-Tasche."},"tip":{"ko":"비를 막는 아우터 안에 포근한 니트를 겹치고 차분한 하의로 균형을 잡아 보세요.","en":"Layer a cosy knit under a coat that keeps the rain out, and balance it with a calm bottom half.","de":"Unter einen regendichten Mantel einen kuscheligen Strick, unten etwas Ruhiges als Ausgleich."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-02.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-02.02-top","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-02.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-02.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-02.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-02.06-bag","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-02.07-umbrella"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-03","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/minimal/03/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"네이비 안에 코발트 한 겹. 가벼운 비를 털어내는 오후.","en":"Navy with a layer of cobalt inside. An afternoon of shaking off light rain.","de":"Navy mit einer Schicht Kobalt darunter. Ein Nachmittag, an dem man leichten Regen abschüttelt."},"article":{"title":"SHAKE OFF THE DRIZZLE","intro":{"ko":"짧은 네이비 레인코트 안에 코발트 모헤어 카디건, 그 안에 차콜 메리노 이너를 한 겹 더. 그레이 플리츠 팬츠와 블랙 더비로 차분하게 정리했어요.","en":"A cobalt mohair cardigan under a short navy rain mac, with a charcoal merino layer beneath. Grey pleated trousers and black derbies keep it calm.","de":"Ein kobaltblauer Mohair-Cardigan unter einem kurzen marineblauen Regenmantel, darunter noch eine anthrazit Merinoschicht. Graue Bundfaltenhose und schwarze Derbys halten es ruhig."},"tip":{"ko":"비를 막는 아우터 안에 포근한 니트를 겹치고 차분한 하의로 균형을 잡아 보세요.","en":"Layer a cosy knit under a coat that keeps the rain out, and balance it with a calm bottom half.","de":"Unter einen regendichten Mantel einen kuscheligen Strick, unten etwas Ruhiges als Ausgleich."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-03.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-03.02-top","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-03.03-under","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-03.04-bottom","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-03.05-socks","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-03.06-shoes","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-03.07-bag","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-03.08-umbrella"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-04","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/minimal/04/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"올리브 후드와 오트밀 니트. 안경 너머의 작은 미소.","en":"An olive hood and an oatmeal knit. A small smile behind the glasses.","de":"Olivgrüne Kapuze und Strick in Haferflockenbeige. Ein kleines Lächeln hinter der Brille."},"article":{"title":"A CLEARER LITTLE MOMENT","intro":{"ko":"딥올리브 후드 레인코트 안에 오트밀 하이넥 니트, 아래는 에스프레소 울 팬츠와 버건디 집 부츠. 따뜻한 갈색 계열에 라운드 메탈 안경이 가볍게 더해져요.","en":"An oatmeal high-neck knit under a deep olive hooded raincoat, espresso wool trousers and burgundy zip boots below. Warm browns, lightened by round metal glasses.","de":"Ein haferbeiger Stehkragenpullover unter einem tief olivgrünen Kapuzenregenmantel, darunter Espresso-Wollhose und bordeauxrote Reißverschlussstiefel. Warme Brauntöne, aufgelockert durch eine runde Metallbrille."},"tip":{"ko":"비를 막는 아우터 안에 포근한 니트를 겹치고 차분한 하의로 균형을 잡아 보세요.","en":"Layer a cosy knit under a coat that keeps the rain out, and balance it with a calm bottom half.","de":"Unter einen regendichten Mantel einen kuscheligen Strick, unten etwas Ruhiges als Ausgleich."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-04.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-04.02-top","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-04.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-04.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-04.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-04.06-bag","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-04.07-eyewear"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-05","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/minimal/05/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"블랙 코트와 오렌지 니트. 계단 위에서 돌아보는 순간.","en":"A black coat and an orange knit. A look back from the top of the steps.","de":"Schwarzer Mantel und oranger Strick. Ein Blick zurück von der obersten Stufe."},"article":{"title":"ONE LAST LOOK BACK","intro":{"ko":"블랙 롱 맥코트 안에 오렌지 모헤어 니트를 살짝, 차콜 울 팬츠와 블랙 앵클부츠. 바람에 날리는 차콜 머플러와 롤톱 토트, 장우산까지 모두 어두운 톤이라 오렌지만 또렷해요.","en":"A glimpse of orange mohair under a long black mac, with charcoal wool trousers and black ankle boots. Scarf, roll-top tote and umbrella all stay dark, so only the orange stands out.","de":"Ein Hauch orangefarbenes Mohair unter einem langen schwarzen Regenmantel, dazu anthrazit Wollhose und schwarze Stiefeletten. Schal, Rolltop-Tasche und Schirm bleiben dunkel, nur das Orange leuchtet."},"tip":{"ko":"비를 막는 아우터 안에 포근한 니트를 겹치고 차분한 하의로 균형을 잡아 보세요.","en":"Layer a cosy knit under a coat that keeps the rain out, and balance it with a calm bottom half.","de":"Unter einen regendichten Mantel einen kuscheligen Strick, unten etwas Ruhiges als Ausgleich."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-05.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-05.02-top","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-05.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-05.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-05.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-05.06-bag","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-05.07-scarf","bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-minimal-05.08-umbrella"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-01","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Female/35+/day/minimal/01/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"차콜 레인코트 안에 아이보리 모헤어. 손바닥 위로 느끼는 가벼운 비.","en":"Ivory mohair inside a charcoal raincoat. Light rain felt in the palm of your hand.","de":"Elfenbeinfarbenes Mohair unter einem anthrazit Regenmantel. Leichter Regen in der offenen Hand."},"article":{"title":"PALM UP TO THE DRIZZLE","intro":{"ko":"벨트가 달린 차콜 레인코트를 풀어 입고 아이보리 모헤어 니트를 보였어요. 차콜 와이드 팬츠와 블랙 첼시부츠, 작은 블랙 크로스백과 가는 실버 목걸이로 단정하게.","en":"A belted charcoal raincoat worn loose over an ivory mohair knit, with charcoal wide trousers and black Chelsea boots. A small black crossbody and a fine silver chain keep it neat.","de":"Ein anthrazit Regenmantel mit Gürtel, offen über elfenbeinfarbenem Mohair, dazu anthrazit weite Hose und schwarze Chelsea-Boots. Eine kleine schwarze Crossbody-Tasche und eine feine Silberkette halten es schlicht."},"tip":{"ko":"비를 막는 아우터 안에 포근한 니트를 겹치고 차분한 하의로 균형을 잡아 보세요.","en":"Layer a cosy knit under a coat that keeps the rain out, and balance it with a calm bottom half.","de":"Unter einen regendichten Mantel einen kuscheligen Strick, unten etwas Ruhiges als Ausgleich."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-01.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-01.02-top","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-01.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-01.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-01.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-01.06-bag","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-01.07-jewelry"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-02","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Female/35+/day/minimal/02/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"네이비와 코발트 니트의 선명한 조합. 우산 아래 작은 웃음.","en":"Navy and a cobalt knit, a vivid pair. A small laugh under the umbrella.","de":"Navy und ein kobaltblauer Strick, ein kräftiges Paar. Ein kleines Lachen unter dem Schirm."},"article":{"title":"A BLUE NOTE IN THE RAIN","intro":{"ko":"긴 네이비 레인 맥코트 안에 코발트 모헤어 터틀넥, 블랙 울 팬츠와 블랙 집 앵클부츠. 네이비 핸드백과 구부러진 손잡이 장우산으로 마무리했어요.","en":"A cobalt mohair turtleneck under a long navy rain mac, with black wool trousers and black zip ankle boots. Finished with a navy handbag and a crook-handled umbrella.","de":"Ein kobaltblauer Mohair-Rollkragen unter einem langen marineblauen Regenmantel, dazu schwarze Wollhose und schwarze Reißverschluss-Stiefeletten. Dazu eine marineblaue Handtasche und ein Stockschirm mit Rundgriff."},"tip":{"ko":"비를 막는 아우터 안에 포근한 니트를 겹치고 차분한 하의로 균형을 잡아 보세요.","en":"Layer a cosy knit under a coat that keeps the rain out, and balance it with a calm bottom half.","de":"Unter einen regendichten Mantel einen kuscheligen Strick, unten etwas Ruhiges als Ausgleich."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-02.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-02.02-top","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-02.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-02.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-02.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-02.06-bag","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-02.07-umbrella"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-03","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Female/35+/day/minimal/03/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"브라운 코트와 오트밀 니트, 토프 팬츠. 문 앞에서 찾은 열쇠.","en":"A brown coat, an oatmeal knit and taupe trousers. The key found at the door.","de":"Brauner Mantel, haferbeiger Strick und taupefarbene Hose. Der Schlüssel, gefunden an der Tür."},"article":{"title":"FOUND THE KEY","intro":{"ko":"에스프레소 레인코트 안에 오트밀 하이넥 니트, 토프 울 팬츠와 옥스블러드 앵클부츠. 오트밀 머플러를 길게 늘어뜨리고 브라운 숄더 토트를 메어 흙빛 톤 하나로 맞췄어요.","en":"An oatmeal high-neck knit under an espresso raincoat, taupe wool trousers and oxblood ankle boots. A long oatmeal scarf and a brown shoulder tote keep everything in one earthy tone.","de":"Ein haferbeiger Stehkragenpullover unter einem espressobraunen Regenmantel, taupefarbene Wollhose und ochsenblutrote Stiefeletten. Ein langer haferbeiger Schal und eine braune Schultertasche halten alles in einem erdigen Ton."},"tip":{"ko":"비를 막는 아우터 안에 포근한 니트를 겹치고 차분한 하의로 균형을 잡아 보세요.","en":"Layer a cosy knit under a coat that keeps the rain out, and balance it with a calm bottom half.","de":"Unter einen regendichten Mantel einen kuscheligen Strick, unten etwas Ruhiges als Ausgleich."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-03.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-03.02-top","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-03.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-03.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-03.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-03.06-bag","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-03.07-scarf"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-04","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Female/35+/day/minimal/04/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"올리브 후드와 크림 터틀넥. 비를 피하는 작은 몸짓.","en":"An olive hood and a cream turtleneck. A small move to dodge the rain.","de":"Olivgrüne Kapuze und cremefarbener Rollkragen. Eine kleine Bewegung, um dem Regen auszuweichen."},"article":{"title":"UNDER AN OLIVE HOOD","intro":{"ko":"넉넉한 후드의 딥올리브 레인코트 안에 크림 리브 터틀넥, 아래는 블랙 팬츠와 블랙 앵클부츠. 블랙 숄더 토트와 작은 골드 후프 이어링으로 마무리했어요.","en":"A cream ribbed turtleneck under a deep olive raincoat with a generous hood, black trousers and black ankle boots below. Finished with a black shoulder tote and tiny gold hoops.","de":"Ein cremefarbener Rippenrollkragen unter einem tief olivgrünen Regenmantel mit großer Kapuze, darunter schwarze Hose und schwarze Stiefeletten. Dazu eine schwarze Schultertasche und kleine goldene Creolen."},"tip":{"ko":"비를 막는 아우터 안에 포근한 니트를 겹치고 차분한 하의로 균형을 잡아 보세요.","en":"Layer a cosy knit under a coat that keeps the rain out, and balance it with a calm bottom half.","de":"Unter einen regendichten Mantel einen kuscheligen Strick, unten etwas Ruhiges als Ausgleich."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-04.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-04.02-top","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-04.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-04.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-04.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-04.06-bag","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-04.07-jewelry"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-05","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"minimal","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Female/35+/day/minimal/05/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"블랙 롱코트에 체리 레드 니트. 울 스커트와 부츠로 이어지는 따뜻한 레이어.","en":"A cherry red knit under a long black coat. Warm layers that carry on into a wool skirt and boots.","de":"Ein kirschroter Strick unter einem langen schwarzen Mantel. Warme Lagen, die in Wollrock und Stiefeln weitergehen."},"article":{"title":"A CHERRY NOTE ON THE STEPS","intro":{"ko":"블랙 롱 레인코트 안에 체리 레드 모헤어 니트, 차콜 울 미디스커트에 블랙 불투명 타이츠와 니하이 부츠. 그레이 머플러와 롤톱 토트, 장우산으로 빗길 계단을 올라요.","en":"A cherry red mohair knit under a long black raincoat, a charcoal wool midi skirt with opaque black tights and knee-high boots. A grey scarf, a roll-top tote and an umbrella for the wet steps.","de":"Ein kirschroter Mohair-Pullover unter einem langen schwarzen Regenmantel, ein anthrazit Woll-Midirock mit blickdichter schwarzer Strumpfhose und kniehohen Stiefeln. Ein grauer Schal, eine Rolltop-Tasche und ein Schirm für die nassen Stufen."},"tip":{"ko":"비를 막는 아우터 안에 포근한 니트를 겹치고 차분한 하의로 균형을 잡아 보세요.","en":"Layer a cosy knit under a coat that keeps the rain out, and balance it with a calm bottom half.","de":"Unter einen regendichten Mantel einen kuscheligen Strick, unten etwas Ruhiges als Ausgleich."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-05.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-05.02-top","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-05.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-05.04-hosiery","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-05.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-05.06-bag","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-05.07-scarf","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-minimal-05.08-umbrella"]},
    {"id":"oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-01","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/night/minimal/01/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"차콜 울과 아이보리 니트, 부드러운 그레이 머플러.","en":"Charcoal wool and an ivory knit, with a soft grey scarf.","de":"Anthrazit Wolle und ein elfenbeinfarbener Strick, dazu ein weicher grauer Schal."},"article":{"title":"THE SCARF MOMENT","intro":{"ko":"무릎 길이 차콜 울 코트 안에 아이보리 하이넥 니트, 블랙 와이드 팬츠와 첼시부츠. 긴 그레이 머플러를 바람에 맡기고 블랙 숄더백을 가볍게 멨어요.","en":"An ivory mock-neck knit under a knee-length charcoal wool coat, black wide trousers and Chelsea boots. A long grey scarf caught in the wind and a slim black shoulder bag.","de":"Ein elfenbeinfarbener Stehkragenpullover unter einem knielangen anthrazit Wollmantel, schwarze weite Hose und Chelsea-Boots. Ein langer grauer Schal im Wind und eine schmale schwarze Schultertasche."}},"items":["oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-01.01-outer","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-01.02-top","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-01.03-bottom","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-01.04-socks","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-01.05-shoes","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-01.06-bag","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-01.07-scarf"]},
    {"id":"oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-02","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/night/minimal/02/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"브라운 레더와 코발트 모헤어, 버건디 로퍼.","en":"Brown leather, cobalt mohair and burgundy loafers.","de":"Braunes Leder, kobaltblaues Mohair und bordeauxrote Loafer."},"article":{"title":"LEATHER AND COBALT","intro":{"ko":"에스프레소 레더 블루종 안에 코발트 모헤어 니트, 토프 플리츠 팬츠와 버건디 로퍼. 책을 넣은 큰 브라운 토트로 서점 앞 저녁을 마무리해요.","en":"A cobalt mohair knit under an espresso leather blouson, taupe pleated trousers and burgundy loafers. A big brown tote full of books for an evening at the bookshop.","de":"Ein kobaltblauer Mohair-Pullover unter einem espressobraunen Lederblouson, taupefarbene Bundfaltenhose und bordeauxrote Loafer. Eine große braune Tote voller Bücher für einen Abend vor der Buchhandlung."}},"items":["oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-02.01-outer","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-02.02-top","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-02.03-bottom","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-02.04-socks","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-02.05-shoes","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-02.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-03","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/night/minimal/03/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"도톰한 베이지 울 코트와 브라운 모헤어 터틀넥.","en":"A thick beige wool coat and a brown mohair turtleneck.","de":"Ein dicker beiger Wollmantel und ein brauner Mohair-Rollkragen."},"article":{"title":"SOFT WOOL LAYERS","intro":{"ko":"도톰한 베이지 울 코트 안에 브라운 모헤어 터틀넥, 크림 스트레이트 팬츠와 다크브라운 앵클부츠. 브라운 숄더백까지 따뜻한 톤 하나로 맞췄어요.","en":"A brown mohair turtleneck under a thick beige wool coat, cream straight trousers and dark brown ankle boots. A brown shoulder bag keeps it all in one warm tone.","de":"Ein brauner Mohair-Rollkragen unter einem dicken beigen Wollmantel, cremefarbene gerade Hose und dunkelbraune Stiefeletten. Eine braune Schultertasche hält alles in einem warmen Ton."}},"items":["oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-03.01-outer","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-03.02-top","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-03.03-bottom","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-03.04-socks","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-03.05-shoes","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-03.06-bag"]},
    {"id":"oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-04","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/night/minimal/04/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"네이비 울 재킷과 그레이 니트의 차분한 레이어.","en":"A navy wool jacket and a grey knit, layered calmly.","de":"Eine marineblaue Wolljacke und ein grauer Strick, ruhig geschichtet."},"article":{"title":"TONAL NAVY","intro":{"ko":"칼라 없는 네이비 울 재킷 안에 그레이 메리노 카디건과 화이트 이너, 네이비 테일러드 팬츠와 블랙 더비. 블랙 크로스백과 레더 장갑으로 저녁 외출 준비를 마쳐요.","en":"A grey merino cardigan and a white base layer under a collarless navy wool jacket, navy tailored trousers and black derbies. A black crossbody and leather gloves for heading out in the evening.","de":"Ein grauer Merino-Cardigan und ein weißes Shirt unter einer kragenlosen marineblauen Wolljacke, marineblaue Stoffhose und schwarze Derbys. Eine schwarze Crossbody-Tasche und Lederhandschuhe für den Abend."}},"items":["oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-04.01-outer","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-04.02-top","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-04.03-base","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-04.04-bottom","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-04.05-socks","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-04.06-shoes","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-04.07-bag","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-04.08-gloves"]},
    {"id":"oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-05","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"cloudy","style":"minimal","gender":"m","age":"35","time":"evening","image":"look/berlin-complete/Overcast/Chilly/Male/35+/night/minimal/05/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"블랙 울 코트 안에 더한 오렌지 모헤어 카디건.","en":"An orange mohair cardigan added inside a black wool coat.","de":"Ein orangefarbener Mohair-Cardigan unter einem schwarzen Wollmantel."},"article":{"title":"A LITTLE AUTUMN FIND","intro":{"ko":"짧은 블랙 울 코트 안에 오렌지 모헤어 카디건과 오프화이트 이너, 그래파이트 울 팬츠와 블랙 집 부츠. 큰 블랙 토트를 들고 가을 저녁 길에서 밤 한 알을 주워요.","en":"An orange mohair cardigan and an off-white base layer under a short black wool coat, graphite wool trousers and black zip boots. A big black tote, and a chestnut picked up on an autumn evening.","de":"Ein orangefarbener Mohair-Cardigan und ein offwhite Shirt unter einem kurzen schwarzen Wollmantel, graphitgraue Wollhose und schwarze Reißverschlussstiefel. Eine große schwarze Tote und eine Kastanie, aufgehoben an einem Herbstabend."}},"items":["oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-05.01-outer","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-05.02-top","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-05.03-base","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-05.04-bottom","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-05.05-socks","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-05.06-shoes","oc-unclassified-m-35-evening-minimal-05.07-bag"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-01","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Female/35+/day/casual/01/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"네이비 퀼팅에 에크루 니트, 바람에 날아갈 비니를 잡는 순간.","en":"Navy quilting, ecru knit and a beanie held against the breeze.","de":"Marineblaue Steppung, ecrufarbener Strick und eine Mütze gegen den Wind."},"article":{"title":"HOLD ON TO YOUR BEANIE","intro":{"ko":"네이비 퀼팅 재킷 안에 에크루 하프집 니트를 입고, 바람이 불면 지퍼를 올려 목을 감싸 주세요. 인디고 스트레이트 진으로 편안한 선을 만들고, 따뜻한 양말을 브라운 첼시 부츠까지 이어 주세요. 비니는 귀를 덮고 작은 크로스보디 백은 두 손을 가볍게 해줍니다.","en":"Layer the ecru half-zip knit under the navy quilted jacket and zip the neckline high when the breeze picks up. Straight indigo jeans keep the shape easy, while warm socks bridge the gap to brown Chelsea boots. The beanie covers the ears and the small crossbody keeps both hands free.","de":"Trage den ecrufarbenen Troyer unter der marineblauen Steppjacke und ziehe den Kragen bei Wind hoch. Gerade Indigojeans halten die Silhouette entspannt; warme Socken schließen die Lücke zu den braunen Chelsea-Boots. Die Mütze bedeckt die Ohren, die kleine Crossbody lässt die Hände frei."},"tip":{"ko":"밖에서는 하프집을 올리고 실내에서는 내려서 따뜻함을 조절해 주세요.","en":"Keep the half-zip high outdoors and lower it indoors to adjust the warmth.","de":"Draußen den Troyer hoch schließen, drinnen den Reißverschluss für weniger Wärme öffnen."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-01.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-01.02-top","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-01.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-01.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-01.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-01.06-bag","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-01.07-headwear"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-02","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Female/35+/day/casual/02/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"초콜릿 재킷과 모스 그린 니트로 빗속 카페 앞을 경쾌하게.","en":"A chocolate aviator jacket and moss knit brighten a rainy café stop.","de":"Schokobraune Fliegerjacke und moosgrüner Strick beim Café-Stopp im Regen."},"article":{"title":"MOSS UNDER THE CANOPY","intro":{"ko":"도톰한 초콜릿 에비에이터 재킷에 보송한 모스 그린 니트와 샌드 와이드 코듀로이 팬츠를 맞춰 주세요. 부드러운 칼라는 목 가까이 세우고, 넓은 바짓단 아래는 단정한 브라운 부츠로 잡아 주세요. 올리브 숄더백으로 니트의 자연스러운 색을 이어 주고, 카페 앞에서는 우산을 더합니다.","en":"Pair the substantial chocolate aviator jacket with a fluffy moss knit and wide sand corduroy trousers. Keep the soft collar close around the neck and balance the generous trousers with compact brown boots. An olive shoulder bag repeats the knit’s earthy tone; the umbrella adds cover for the short café stop.","de":"Kombiniere die warme schokobraune Fliegerjacke mit flauschigem moosgrünem Strick und einer weiten sandfarbenen Cordhose. Der weiche Kragen liegt nah am Hals, kompakte braune Boots gleichen die weite Hose aus. Die olivgrüne Schultertasche greift den Erdton des Pullovers auf; am Café schützt zusätzlich ein Schirm."},"tip":{"ko":"넓은 바짓단은 바닥에 끌리지 않게, 보송한 니트는 재킷 안으로 보호해 주세요.","en":"Let the wide hems clear the pavement and keep the fluffy knit protected beneath the jacket.","de":"Die weiten Säume sollten nicht aufliegen; schütze den flauschigen Strick unter der Jacke."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-02.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-02.02-top","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-02.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-02.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-02.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-02.06-bag","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-02.07-umbrella"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-03","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Female/35+/day/casual/03/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"자전거 옆 토프 파카에 코발트 니트와 머플러를 겹쳐요.","en":"A taupe parka meets cobalt layers beside the bicycle rack.","de":"Taupefarbener Parka trifft auf kobaltblaue Lagen am Fahrradständer."},"article":{"title":"A COBALT KIND OF DAY","intro":{"ko":"토프 보온 파카 안에 코발트 하이넥 니트를 입고 머플러와 비니도 같은 블루로 이어 주세요. 차콜 데님과 블랙 러그솔 부츠가 선명한 상체 색을 차분하게 받쳐 줍니다. 백팩으로 손을 자유롭게 하고, 바람이 차가워지면 파카를 여며 니트 위를 감싸 주세요.","en":"Wear the taupe insulated parka over a cobalt high-neck knit, then repeat the blue in the scarf and beanie. Charcoal jeans and black lug-sole boots ground the bright upper layers. The backpack leaves hands free for everyday errands; close the parka over the knit when the wind turns colder.","de":"Trage den gefütterten taupefarbenen Parka über einem kobaltblauen Stehkragenpullover und wiederhole das Blau mit Schal und Mütze. Anthrazitfarbene Jeans und schwarze Boots mit Profilsohle erden die kräftige Farbe. Der Rucksack hält die Hände frei; bei kaltem Wind den Parka über dem Strick schließen."},"tip":{"ko":"머플러 끝은 파카 안에 넣고 데님을 접을 때는 양말이 발목을 계속 덮도록 해주세요.","en":"Keep the scarf ends inside the parka and any jean cuffs shallow enough for socks to cover the ankle.","de":"Stecke die Schalenden in den Parka und kremple Jeans nur so weit, dass die Socken die Knöchel bedecken."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-03.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-03.02-top","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-03.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-03.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-03.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-03.06-bag","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-03.07-headwear","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-03.08-scarf"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-04","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Female/35+/day/casual/04/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"올리브 후드 속 크림슨 니트, 목에는 포근한 차콜 머플러.","en":"An olive hood, crimson knit and a scarf pulled close.","de":"Olivgrüne Kapuze, tiefroter Strick und ein eng gewickelter Schal."},"article":{"title":"COZY IN THE GUST","intro":{"ko":"올리브 푸퍼로 볼륨을 만들고 크림슨 니트는 작지만 따뜻한 컬러 포인트로 보여 주세요. 차콜 머플러를 목 가까이 두르고 후드를 올린 뒤, 작은 크로스보디 백으로 정리합니다. 하의는 스타일링 기획에 맞춰 다크 인디고 진과 블랙 보온 양말, 플랫 레이스업 부츠를 연결해 주세요.","en":"Let the olive puffer provide the volume and keep the crimson knit as a small warm flash of color. Wrap the charcoal scarf close, lift the hood, and keep the crossbody bag compact. Dark indigo jeans, warm black socks and flat lace-up boots complete the lower half proposed in the styling brief.","de":"Die olivgrüne Steppjacke bringt Volumen, der tiefrote Pullover setzt einen kleinen warmen Farbakzent. Wickle den anthrazitfarbenen Schal eng, setze die Kapuze auf und halte die Crossbody kompakt. Dunkle Indigojeans, warme schwarze Socken und flache Schnürboots ergänzen den im Styling vorgesehenen unteren Teil."},"tip":{"ko":"후드와 머플러를 가까이 여미되 목 아래 붉은 니트는 조금 남겨 주세요.","en":"Keep the hood and scarf close without covering the crimson color at the neckline completely.","de":"Kapuze und Schal liegen nah an, ein wenig Rot darf am Ausschnitt sichtbar bleiben."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-04.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-04.02-top","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-04.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-04.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-04.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-04.06-bag","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-04.07-scarf"]},
    {"id":"bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-05","bands":["chilly"],"sky":"rain","rain":"light","style":"street","gender":"f","age":"35","image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Female/35+/day/casual/05/editorial.jpg","deck":{"ko":"블랙 워크 재킷과 카멜 머플러, 돌아가는 길에는 옥스블러드 부츠.","en":"A black barn jacket, camel scarf and oxblood boots for the walk home.","de":"Schwarze Barn-Jacke, Camelschal und bordeauxrote Boots für den Heimweg."},"article":{"title":"ONE MORE BAKERY STOP","intro":{"ko":"짧은 블랙 워크 재킷 안에 오트밀 청키 니트를 겹치고 카멜 머플러를 칼라 안쪽으로 둘러 주세요. 워시드 그레이 진으로 힘을 빼고 옥스블러드 첼시 부츠로 깊이를 더합니다. 바짓단은 젖은 바닥에서 살짝 띄우고 토트백은 우산 아래 몸 가까이 들어 주세요.","en":"Layer the oatmeal chunky knit under the short black barn jacket and wrap the camel scarf inside the collar. Washed gray jeans keep the outfit relaxed; oxblood Chelsea boots add depth without a loud contrast. Keep the hem off wet paving and carry the tote close beneath the umbrella.","de":"Trage den haferfarbenen Grobstrick unter der kurzen schwarzen Barn-Jacke und lege den Camelschal in den Kragen. Verwaschene graue Jeans wirken entspannt, bordeauxrote Chelsea-Boots geben dem Look Tiefe. Die Säume bleiben über dem nassen Pflaster, der Shopper nah am Körper unter dem Schirm."},"tip":{"ko":"다시 바람 속으로 나가기 전에 머플러 끝을 재킷 안에 넣어 주세요.","en":"Tuck the scarf ends into the jacket before stepping back into the wind.","de":"Stecke die Schalenden in die Jacke, bevor du wieder in den Wind trittst."}},"items":["bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-05.01-outer","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-05.02-top","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-05.03-bottom","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-05.04-socks","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-05.05-shoes","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-05.06-bag","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-05.07-scarf","bl-light-chilly-f-35-day-casual-05.08-umbrella"]}
