    "bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-04.03-bottom": {"id":"bl-light-chilly-m-35-day-run-04.03-bottom","cat":"bottom","name":{"ko":"차콜 테이퍼드 러닝 팬츠","en":"Charcoal tapered running pants","de":"Anthrazit Laufhose, schmal zulaufend"},"note":{"ko":"타이츠보다 여유 있는 핏을 원할 때. 발목이 좁아 물이 덜 튀어요.","en":"When you want more room than tights. Narrow ankles mean fewer splashes.","de":"Wenn du mehr Raum als in Tights willst. Schmale Knöchel, weniger Spritzer."},"image":"look/berlin-complete/Rain/Light/Chilly/Male/35+/day/running/04/products/03-bottom.jpg","alt":"차콜 테이퍼드 러닝 팬츠 - 아이보리 배경의 개별 제품 컷","bg":"#F3EEE8"},
